<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JHN" style="id">2022</book>
  <para style="h">Johani</para>
  <para style="toc1">Evangeli thza Johani</para>
  <para style="toc2">Johani</para>
  <para style="toc3">Joh</para>
  <para style="mt2">Evangeli thza</para>
  <para style="mt1">Johani</para>
  <para style="rem">Ecidimukithsa yo vuka thza Johani</para>
  <para style="rem">Ethzi vuka po Johani wa thzi ñorire, oyu wekarire yumweya o tunganda twa Yesu to dikumi na twidi. Shime a ñorire ethzi vuka ku kwathsa Majuda nanu amweya kengeyo ku tawa kwa Yesu. Ka a tongorire yo mwoyo wa Yesu, unone kupita ku tenda kengeyo, aa endererithsa emonithso yoingi eyi a kwamine Yesu nerongithsa eyi a pire. Eyi yaa monithsa ci Yesu po kadi munu shemwa pohuma unone karo Nyambi.</para>
  <para style="rem">Ethzi vuka thzaa tateka ko ku monithsa ci Yesu po nedi diywi dya Nyambi, nji ci muthzimbu ku kaye, no kuninga ci kufa kwenthzi kenge kwa kwikara thsiyambero thso ku tundithsa evi yo kaye, karo ci nedi yodiyo Mesiya oyu kwokethziwire kukeya kwenthzi mu Tesitamente Thzokare. Mwithsiano yo 13-17 Johani aa tongonona yo thsishimo thsa Yesu kwirongwa yenthzi no maywi enthzi o ku i hengawethza runguro o diya diyuwa dya randire diya a kwatiwire. Mamaneneno othzi vuka aa amba edi a raturiwire Yesu no kwambiwa pa mbinda, nedi a pindukire kwafu no ku monahara kwirongwa yenthzi miendo thzothzingi.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JHN 1" />
  <para style="rem">TA, TC, CC, HS, CT2, TA, BM</para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu po Diywi dyo mwoyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 1:1" />Ku matatekero Diywi ko dyekarire. Karo Diywi dyekarire kwa Nyambi, mane nedi Nyambi. <verse eid="JHN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 1:2" />Wekarire kwa Nyambi ku tunda ku matatekero. <verse eid="JHN 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 1:3" />Nyambi wombire enu yoihe kenthzi, karo kwithsa ethsi thsombiwire ko kupira aye. <verse eid="JHN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 1:4" />Ku kwenthzi kwekarire mwoyo, karo oo mwoyo wa retire mwethzi kwanu wahe. <verse eid="JHN 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 1:5" />Mwethzi waa muneka mu mirema, karo mirema ka na thzi u othzo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mirema ka na thzi u yuvithsithsa.</char></note>.<verse eid="JHN 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 1:6" />Nyambi wa tumine mukwerume o dithzina dyo Johani, <verse eid="JHN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 1:7" />ku na pa ombangi keyi yoo mwethzi ci munu yomuhe a tawe mukaci kombangi wenthzi. <verse eid="JHN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 1:8" />Aye nedi ka di cingwa yodiyo mwethzi, unone shime a keyire ku na pa ombangi o o mwethzi. <verse eid="JHN 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 1:9" />Aye mwethzi shemwa, oyu munekera anu wahe, o ku keya mu kaye.<verse eid="JHN 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 1:10" />Wekarire mu kaye aka ombire, unone kaye ka ka mu dimukire. <verse eid="JHN 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 1:11" />Wa keyire kwanuenthzi shemwa, unone awo ka mu tamburire. <verse eid="JHN 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 1:12" />Unone wahe awa mu tamburire no ku tawa ku kwenthzi, wa wa pire okoro o kwikara ana Nyambi. <verse eid="JHN 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 1:13" />A nerekiwa ope, uno honi kadi konyinga nji keshima yerama nji keshima yo mukwerume, unone kwerekiwa ko ku tunderera kwa Nyambi.<verse eid="JHN 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 1:14" />Diywi dya pirukire munu no ku tunga mu kaci ketu. Na tu mono kutethzima kwenthzi, kutethzima kwa Mwana yofoci pakamutwa oyu naa tundu kwa Tata, aye o kuyara thsihemo noshemwa.<verse eid="JHN 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 1:15" />Johani wa na pire ombangi keyi yenthzi, wa kuererire ci: “Oyu yodiyo na ambire yenthzi uya na ambire ci: ‘Kwaa di oyu keya o mukuru ku kwange oyu keya mu nyima thzange, inene kwa ekarire ame o ku ni shime.’”<verse eid="JHN 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 1:16" />Inene mu kuyara kwenthzi twahe na tu rundekiwera rundekiwera thsihemo. <verse eid="JHN 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 1:17" />Inene murao shime wa piwire ka Mushe, unone thsihemo noshemwa ya keyire ka Yesu Krisitu. <verse eid="JHN 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 1:18" />Kwithsa oyu wa mona Nyambi, shime aye Mwane yofoci pakamutwa, aye Nyambi shemwa, oyu di mu mbando thza Tata. Yodiyo naa mu hokora ku kwetu.<verse eid="JHN 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ombangi wa Johani Mukwakukorovethza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Mat 3.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Mar 1.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luk 3.1-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 1:19" />Ou wodiyo ombangi a pire Johani, Majuda o ku Yerusalema ou a tumine mapurisita no Malivi ku na mwipura ci: “Yowe odye?” <verse eid="JHN 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 1:20" />Johani wa pire ombangi, ka a hamurire, unone wa pire ombangi ci: “Kadi yame no Mesiya.”<verse eid="JHN 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 1:21" />Ngou a mwipurire ci: “Yowe odye honi ne? Yowe o Eliya nji?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">Wa ambire ci: “Dyombo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">Nji yowe o Mukwakukethza oyu tu taterera?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">Wa tawire ci: “Dyombo.”<verse eid="JHN 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 1:22" />“Nji yowe odye honi ne? Twaa fota eyi tu ka tongwera awa a na tu tumu. O ciambere, yowe odye?”<verse eid="JHN 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 1:23" />Johani wa tawire ko ku cikwathsithsa maywi a mukwakukethza Isaya ci:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 1:23">“Yame no diywi edi di kuerera mu dikunguthsitu ci:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 1:23">‘Mu orore mukwakwa wa Fumu!’”<verse eid="JHN 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 1:24" />Afarithsi awa a tumiwire ngou <verse eid="JHN 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 1:25" />epurire ci: “Ine honi eyi o korovethzera ngeci ka di yowe o Mesiya nji Eliya nji Mukwakukethza oyu tu na taterera?”<verse eid="JHN 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 1:26" />Johani wa wa tawire ci: “Naa mi korovethza ko meyu, uno honi mu kaci kenu mwaa di oyu mu na kana ku dimuka. <verse eid="JHN 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 1:27" />Yodiyo oyu keya munyima thzange, ka ni roerire shaanga ku putura tuangithso to mashangu enthzi.”<verse eid="JHN 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 1:28" />Eyi yoihe shime ya tendaharerire mu Betania<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Thza ethsiwa karo ci Betabara.</char></note>, ndau thzo ku muvo o Rware rwa Jorodani, oku a korovethzerire Johani. <figure style="fig" alt="John declares Jesus to be the 'Lamb of God'" file="wa03813b.tif" size="col" loc="Jhn 1:29-31" copy="Wade" ref="1.29-31">Johani aa amba ci Yesu po yodiyo “Dinguana dya Nyambi”</figure><verse eid="JHN 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu, Dinguana dya Nyambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 1:29" />Diyuwa edi dya randireko, Johani wa monine Yesu o ku mu tamba. Ngou a ambire ci: “Mu mone! Oya Dinguana dya Nyambi, aye o ku tundithsa thsivi thso kaye! <verse eid="JHN 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 1:30" />Yodiyo na ambire yenthzi uya na ambire ci: ‘Munyima thzange aa keya mukwerume o mukuru ku kwange, inene kwa ekarire ame o ku ni shime.’ <verse eid="JHN 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 1:31" />Ka na mu dimukire ci yodiyo Mesiya, unone na ni korovethza ko meyu ci a dimukiwe kwanu o mu Isiraele.”<verse eid="JHN 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 1:32" />Johani wa pire ombangi ci: “Na monine Mupepo o ku u keya ku tunda ku wiru eci dikuci no ku na tura pa penthzi. <verse eid="JHN 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 1:33" />Ka na mu dimukire, unone oyu wa ni tumine ku na korovethza ko meyu, wa ni amberire ci: ‘Oyu wa ku mona o ku u mu shurumukera Mupepo Oukenu no ku na tura pa penthzi yodiyo wa ku korovethza ko Mupepo Oukenu.’ <verse eid="JHN 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 1:34" />Na ni mono eyi o ku i tendahara kwa Yesu, mweyo, naa pa ombangi ci yodiyo Mwana Nyambi.”<verse eid="JHN 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aethsa erongwa yo kutanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 1:35" />Diyuwa edi dya randireko, Johani shime emanine karo nerongwa idi kwirongwa yenthzi. <verse eid="JHN 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 1:36" />Yesu o ku pitapita, Johani wa mu kengererire no ku amba ci: “Mu mone! Dinguana dya Nyambi oya!” <verse eid="JHN 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 1:37" />Eyo erongwa idi ya Johani ou ya yuvire eyi, ya shupwerire Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 1:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 1:38" />Yesu wa cithsetukire no ku i mona o ku i mu shupwera, wa i amberire ci: “Ine eyi mu fota?” Ya tawire ci: “Rabi,” (ku amba ci Murongithsi), “kupi oku o nekaranga?” <verse eid="JHN 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 1:39" />Wa i tawire ci: “Mu keye na mu mone.” Ya thzire no ku ka mona oku na ekaranga, karo ya ka onthzire nenthzi, inene nedi runguro.<verse eid="JHN 1:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 1:40" />Yumweya kwawo aidi awa a yuvire eyi a ambire Johani no ku shupwera Yesu po nedi Andereasi mina Simoni Peturu. <verse eid="JHN 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 1:41" />Thso kutanga ethsi a kwamine Andereasi po ku thza ku ka fota mukurwe Simoni no ku mu ambera ci: “Tu na mu wana Mesiya (ku amba ci Krisitu).”<verse eid="JHN 1:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 1:42" />Ngou Andereasi a retire Simoni kwa Yesu. Yesu wa mu kengererire thsithzui no ku amba ci: “Yowe o Simoni mwana Johani. Ku tunda pano kenge wa kwithsiwa Kefasi (ku amba ci Peturu nji ci Diwe).”<verse eid="JHN 1:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aethsa Filipu na Natanaele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 1:43" />Diyuwa edi dya randireko, Yesu wa anekerire ku thza ku Galilea. Wa wanine Filipu no ku mu ambera ci: “O ni shupwere.” <verse eid="JHN 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 1:44" />Filipu po nedi wa ku Betisaida, mbongi omu a tungire a Andereasi na Peturu.<verse eid="JHN 1:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 1:45" />Filipu wa wanine Natanaele, ayepo mu ambera ci: “Tu na mu wana oya munu a ambire yenthzi Mushe mu Murao, aye oyu karo a ñorire yenthzi akwakukethza. Yodiyo Yesu dithzina dyenthzi, mwana Josefa o ku Nazareta.”<verse eid="JHN 1:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 1:46" />Natanaele wa mwipurire ci: “Ene kenge nga ku tunda thsinu thsothsiwa mu Nazareta?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:46">Filipu wa mu tawire ci: “O keye no mone!”<verse eid="JHN 1:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 1:47" />Yesu ou a monine Natanaele o ku keya ku kwenthzi, wa ambire yenthzi ci: “Oyu po Muisiraele shemwa o kupira kwangera.”<verse eid="JHN 1:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 1:48" />Natanaele wepurire Yesu ci: “Waa ni dimuka ngepi?” Yesu wa mu tawire ci: “Shime naa ku mona o ku di mwimi thzo thsitondo thsokuyu Filipu o ku shime ku kwithsa.”<verse eid="JHN 1:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 1:49" />Natanaele wa tawire ci: “Murongithsi, yowe o Mwana Nyambi! Yowe o Fumu wa Isiraele!”<verse eid="JHN 1:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 1:50" />Yesu wa mwipurire ci: “Ene waa tawa pakuninga ci ni na ku tongwera ci shime naa ku mona mwimi thzo thsitondo thsokuyu? Kenge wa ku mona enu yoikuru kupita eyi.” <verse eid="JHN 1:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 1:51" />Yesu wa ambire karo ci: “Naa mi tongwera yoshemwa ci kenge mwa ku mona diwiru o ku di na yanthzuruka no tungeru twa Nyambi o ku tu thzina mu wiru no ku shiruka mu wiru peuru thza Mwana Munu.”<verse eid="JHN 1:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JHN 2" />
  <para style="rem">TA, TC, CC, HS, TA, BM, CT2</para>
  <para style="s1">Thsidika thso wenga mu Kana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 2:1" />Munyima thzo mayuwa edi, kwekarire thsidika thso wenga mu diumbo edi di nethsiwa Kana mu ditunga dya Galilea. Mama wa Yesu naye kwa ekarire. <verse eid="JHN 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 2:2" />Yesu nerongwa yenthzi nawo a raiwire oko ku wenga. <verse eid="JHN 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 2:3" />Waine ou a pwire, Yesu wa mu amberire mama wenthzi ci: “O na wa pwera waine.”<verse eid="JHN 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 2:4" />Yesu wa tawire ci: “Mama, ine yo ku ni pakera mwinu yo kengeyo? Thsikati thsange thsi shime ku kuma.”<verse eid="JHN 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 2:5" />Mama wenthzi wa amberire angamba ci: “Mu kwame yoihe eyi a mi ambera.”<figure style="fig" alt="Jesus turns water into wine" file="dn00453b.tif" size="col" loc="Jhn 2:5-10" copy="Dunham" ref="2.5-10">Yesu aa pirura meyu waine</figure><verse eid="JHN 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 2:6" />Apo kwekarire manafe o mawe o mutanu na dyofoci aa a cikwathsithsangire Majuda ku cikenithsa ko thsithsemwa. Dinafe no dinafe dyaa ronga makopokopo ane nji o mutanu. <verse eid="JHN 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 2:7" />Yesu wa amberire angamba ci: “Mu yarithse aa manafe o mawe meyu.” Ngou a a yarithsire katere ko ku miromo. <verse eid="JHN 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 2:8" />Wa wa amberire karo ci: “Mu vetemo honi mu twarere muendithsi o thsidika.” Awo ngou a a mu twarerire.<verse eid="JHN 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 2:9" />Muendithsi o thsidika wa humburire mwao meyu a pirukire waine. Ka a dimukire oku a tundire, shaanga ci angamba awa vetavetire meyu a dimukire. Ngou ethsire mukwakuyeka. <verse eid="JHN 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 2:10" />Wa mu amberire ci: “Anu wahe aa tanganga ku pa waine o mutowi, o kwa na nu wahe kukwana mbeci honi a rete waine o muhamu. Uno honi owe shime o na tureka waine o mutowi tango shime ku na kuma thsino thsikati!”<verse eid="JHN 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 2:11" />Ethsi thsimonithso thso ku komokithsa a tendire Yesu mu Kana o mu Galilea thsodiyo thso kutanga kwimonithso yenthzi ku hokora kutethzima kwenthzi. Erongwa yenthzi ya tawire ku kwenthzi.<verse eid="JHN 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 2:12" />Munyima thzeyo, Yesu wa urumukire ku thza ku Kapenauma na mama wenthzi, naminenthzi nerongwa yenthzi oku a kekarire mayuwa oapu pohuma.<verse eid="JHN 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa kanithsa anu ku urithsera mu Tembere</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-13">Mat 21.12-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-17">Mar 11.15-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-46">Luk 19.45-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 2:13" />Thsidika thso Majuda ethsi thsi nethsiwa Paseka o ku thsi di po pepi no ku tendahara, Yesu wa kambamine ku thza ku Yerusalema. <verse eid="JHN 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 2:14" />Ou a thzire ku Tembere wa ka wanine anu awa urithseriremo ngombe no mangu no mayembe. Karo wa monine akwakucinja madi o kwa nekara ku matafure. <verse eid="JHN 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 2:15" />Yesu wa kwamine thsiwepu pa miothzi no ku wa cithzacithza wahe mu Tembere mofoci kengeyo no mangu no ngombe thzo. Wa thzire o hanyahanya muwayawaya wakwakucinja madi no ku huwa matafure o. <verse eid="JHN 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 2:16" />Wa amberire awa urithsire mayembe ci: “Mu i tundithse muno eyi! Mwa pirura nthzio thza Tata maurithsero!”<verse eid="JHN 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 2:17" />Erongwa ya vurukire eyi i na ñoriwa mu Mañoro yo ku amba ci: “Thsishimo thsange thso nthzio thzoe thsaa ni pithsa ku mucima eci mudiro.”<verse eid="JHN 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 2:18" />Unone Majuda epurire Yesu ci: “Thsimonithso mwine o tenda ethsi thsi tu monithsa ci yo shemwa waa roera ku tenda kengeyo?”<verse eid="JHN 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 2:19" />Yesu wa wa tawire ci: “Mu umburure thzino Tembere, ame kenge na ku thzi pindura mu mayuwa ahatu.” <verse eid="JHN 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 2:20" />Majuda a mu amberire ci: “Ethzi Tembere thza shimbire myaka thzo makumi ane no mutanu na ofoci ku thzi umba. Owe honi ne ngepi nga wa ku thzi pindura no ku thzi umba mu mayuwa ahatu?” <verse eid="JHN 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 2:21" />Uno honi Tembere ethzi a ningire Yesu po erama yenthzi. <verse eid="JHN 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 2:22" />Munyima thzo ku pinduriwa kwafu, erongwa yenthzi ya vurukire ci shime aa wa tongwera eyi. Mweyo a tawire eyi i na ñoriwa mu Mañoro neyi a ambire Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu o na dimuka eanekera yo munu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 2:23" />Yesu o ku di mu Yerusalema pa Thsidika thso Paseka, anu owangi a tawire ku kwenthzi mukaci kemonithso yo ku komokithsa eyi a tendire. <verse eid="JHN 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 2:24" />Unone Yesu aye ka a wa kuruperire, inene wahe shime a wa dimukerire nawa. <verse eid="JHN 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 2:25" />Yesu ka a ningire ci shime munu a mu tongwere yanu, inene aye thsinda wa dimukire eyi yekarire mu micima thzo.<verse eid="JHN 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JHN 3" />
  <para style="rem">TA, TC, CC, HS, CT2, TA, BM</para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu na Nikodema</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 3:1" />Kwekarire mukwerume o dithzina dyo Nikodema, nedi nduna o Majuda o mu thsikwata thsAfarithsi. <verse eid="JHN 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 3:2" />Wa keyire kwa Yesu othsiku no ku na mu ambera ci: “Murongithsi, tu na dimuka ci Nyambi naa ku tumu ku na tu rongithsa, inene kwithsa munu o ku twethsa ku kwama emonithso yo mushovo ou shime ngeci Nyambi nenthzi a di.”<verse eid="JHN 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 3:3" />Yesu wa mu tawire ci: “Naa ku tongwera yoshemwa ci kwithsa munu oyu wa ku mona Kutumina kwa Nyambi shime ci erekiwe ro muthsidi.”<verse eid="JHN 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 3:4" />Nikodema wa mwipurire ci: “Munu ne ngepi edi nga a twethsa kwerekiwa ro muthsidi o ku na kuru? Ene kenge nga i tawa ci munu a hukere mu dira dya mama wenthzi no kwerekiwa ro muthsidi?”<verse eid="JHN 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 3:5" />Yesu wa mu tawire ci: “Naa ku tongwera yoshemwa ci kwithsa o ku twethsa kwingena mu Kutumina kwa Nyambi ko kukana kwerekiwa ko meyu no Mupepo. <verse eid="JHN 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 3:6" />Thso kwerekiwa ko nyama po nyama, karo thso kwerekiwa ko Mupepo po mupepo. <verse eid="JHN 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 3:7" />Wa i komoka eyi ni na ku ambera ci waa roera kwerekiwa ro muthsidi. <verse eid="JHN 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 3:8" />Mupepo waa pepera kokuhe oku u na shimi, owe waa twethsa ku yuva muyoyo wao, unone tumba o twethsa ku dimuka oku u tunderera noku u thza. Dyo i di no ku munu yomuhe o ku tambura kwerekiwa kokupe ko ku tunderera ku Mupepo.”<verse eid="JHN 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 3:9" />Nikodema wa mwipurire ci: “Ene ngepi nga i dikara enu yo kenge?”<verse eid="JHN 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 3:10" />Yesu wa mu tawire ci: “Owe po o murongithsi wa Isiraele, ine eyi o kana ku yuvithsithsa eyi enu? <verse eid="JHN 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 3:11" />Naa mi tongwera yoshemwa ci twaa amba eyi tu na dimuka no ku pa ombangi weyi tu na mono, unone amwe kadi mwa kwa ku tambura ombangi wetu. <verse eid="JHN 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 3:12" />Ngeci naa mi tongwera enu yo kaye unone kadi mwa kwa ku tawa, ngepi honi nga mu tawa ou nga ni mi tongwera yo ku wiru. <verse eid="JHN 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 3:13" />Kwithsa munu oyu wa thzina mu wiru shime Mwana Munu oyu wa tundire ku wiru. <verse eid="JHN 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 3:14" />Dyodi a kurekire Mushe diya diyoka dyo kopa ku thsitondo mu dikunguthsitu<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 21:8-9">Muta 21.8-9</ref>. </char></note>, no Mwana Munu naye dyaa na roera ku kurekiwa, <verse eid="JHN 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 3:15" />ci yomuhe oyu wa ku tawa ku kwenthzi a ku wane mwoyo o diyere.<verse eid="JHN 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 3:16" />“Inene Nyambi wa shimine nene kaye ku ninga ci mane wa ka pire Mwane yofoci pakamutwa ci munu yomuhe o ku tawa ku kwenthzi a ku nonga, unone a ku wane mwoyo o diyere. <verse eid="JHN 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 3:17" />Inene Nyambi kadi cingwa shime a tumine Mwane mu kaye ku na ka ratura, unone ci kaye nga ka yoyithsiwe kenthzi.<verse eid="JHN 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 3:18" />“Yomuhe o ku tawa ku kwenthzi ka a ku raturiwa, unone yomuhe o kukana ku tawa o na raturiwa kare, inene ka a tawire kwa Mwana Nyambi yofoci pakamutwa. <verse eid="JHN 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 3:19" />Ethsi na thsi reta raturo po ethsi: Mwethzi na u keya mu kaye, unone anu a shimine mirema kupita ku shima mwethzi, inene etenda yo po nedi imango. <verse eid="JHN 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 3:20" />Munu yomuhe o ku tenda yoimango aa thzimba mwethzi karo tumba a henyena ku mwethzi ku yapithsa ci ekwama yenthzi ya dimukiwa. <verse eid="JHN 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 3:21" />Unone yomuhe o ku tenda yo shemwa aa keya mu mwethzi ci nga i monahare nawa etenda yenthzi ci yaa kwamiwa ko ku hengeka eraa ya Nyambi.”<verse eid="JHN 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Johani aa pa karo ombangi keyi ya Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 3:22" />Munyima thzeyi, Yesu nerongwa yenthzi a thzire mu ditunga dya Judea. Wa kekarirekono no ku ka korovethza anu.<verse eid="JHN 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 3:23" />Johani naye shime a korovethzire mu Enoni pepi no Salimu, inene kwekarire meyu oangi. Anu a thzangire ku kwenthzi karo wa wa korovethzangire. <verse eid="JHN 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 3:24" />Eyi shime ya tendaharire Johani o ku shime ku pakiwa mu kamenga. <verse eid="JHN 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 3:25" />Erongwa imweya ya Johani ya tatekire ku cikanyeka no Mujuda yumweya keyi yo thsithsemwa thso kucikenithsa. <verse eid="JHN 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 3:26" />A keyire kwa Johani no ku na mu ambera ci: “Murongithsi, oya mukwerume wekarire nenthzi mu thsambwadiya thzo Rware rwa Jorodani, oya wa tongaurire keyi yenthzi, aa korovethza anu, karo wahe aa thza ku kwenthzi.”<verse eid="JHN 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 3:27" />Johani wa tawire ci: “Kwithsa munu o ku twethsa ku tambura thsinu shime Nyambi o ku na thsi mu pa. <verse eid="JHN 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 3:28" />Amwe po mwa mambangi ange, shime naa amba ci: ‘Kadi yame no Krisitu, unone ame shime na ni tumiwa ku rupara rwenthzi.’ <verse eid="JHN 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 3:29" />Mwenga po wa mukwakuyeka, unone mbusha mukwakuyeka aemana po pepi ku mu teerera, no ku nyanyuka yoihe a yuva diywi dya mukwakuyeka. Mweyo, pano honi thsinyanyu thsange thsi na kwanenena. <verse eid="JHN 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 3:30" />Aye aa roera ku kura, ame naa roera ku popwa.”<verse eid="JHN 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 3:31" />O ku tunda ku wiru o di peuru thzenu yoihe, unone o ku tunda mu kaye wa mu kaye, karo aa amba yo mu kaye. O ku tunda ku wiru o di peuru thzenu yoihe. <verse eid="JHN 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 3:32" />Aa pa ombangi weyi naa mono no ku yuva, unone kwithsa oyu na tambura ombangi wenthzi. <verse eid="JHN 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 3:33" />Yomuhe o ku tambura ou ombangi aa tanarithsa ci Nyambi po wa shemwa. <verse eid="JHN 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 3:34" />Inene oyu naa tumu Nyambi wa ku amba maywi a Nyambi, inene Nyambi aa perereranga Mupepo Oukenu. <verse eid="JHN 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 3:35" />Tata aa shima Mwane karo o na paka enu yoihe mu moko enthzi. <verse eid="JHN 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 3:36" />Yomuhe o ku tawa kwa Mwana o di no mwoyo o diyere, unone yomuhe o kukana ku yuvera Mwana, mbera ka a mono mwoyo o diyere, Nyambi kenge mba a mu anthzipera diyere.<verse eid="JHN 3:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JHN 4" />
  <para style="rem">TA, TC, CC, HS, CT2, TA, BM, PNLT</para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu no mbuyama o Musamaria</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 4:1" />Afarithsi a yuvire ci Yesu aa wana no ku korovethza erongwa yoingi kupita Johani, <verse eid="JHN 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 4:2" />uno honi kadi Yesu wa korovethzire, unone nedi erongwa yenthzi. <verse eid="JHN 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 4:3" />Yesu ou a yuvire eyo, wa tundire mu Judea no ku huka ku Galilea.<verse eid="JHN 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 4:4" />Ku thza ku Galilea, shime ou a pitire mu ditunga dya Samaria. <verse eid="JHN 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 4:5" />Wa kumine mu mbongi thzo mu Samaria ethzi thzi nethsiwa Sikare, pepi no dikanda edi a pire Jakovo mwanenthzi Josefa. <verse eid="JHN 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 4:6" />Apo podiyo dyekarire dithsima dya Jakovo. Yesu wa thzire no ku kekara ku mbadi thzedyo dithsima mukaci ko ku aya ko ruendo karo diyuwa o ku di di pa kaci ko mutwi. <figure style="fig" alt="Jesus and a Samaritan woman" file="dn00433b.tif" size="col" loc="Jhn 4:7-10" copy="Dunham" ref="4.7-10">Yesu no mbuyama o Musamaria pa dithsima</figure><verse eid="JHN 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 4:7" />Kwa keyire mbuyama o mu Samaria ku na veta meyu. Yesu wa mu rombire ci: “Ni peko meyu o ku nwa.” <verse eid="JHN 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 4:8" />Erongwa yenthzi ayo o ku i na thzi mu mbongi ku ka ura edya.<verse eid="JHN 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 4:9" />Oyo mbuyama o Musamaria wa amberire Yesu ci: “Owepo o Mujuda, ngepi honi edi nga o ni romba meyu o ku nwa ame no Musamaria?” Inene Majuda ka cipakererangire no Masamaria.<verse eid="JHN 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 4:10" />Yesu wa mu tawire ci: “Nga o na dimuka thsipa thsa Nyambi, no ku dimuka oyu na ku rombo meyu ci edye, nga yowe o na mu rombo karo nga na ku pa meyu o mwoyo.”<verse eid="JHN 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 4:11" />Oya mbuyama wa mu amberire ci: “Ñathsire wange, owe ko di no thsivetithso karo edi dithsima di thzungi. Oku honi nga o wana ao meyu o mwoyo ne kupi? <verse eid="JHN 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 4:12" />Ene owe ne o mukuru mu thsivaka kupita mukwathsañuru wetu Jakovo oyu wa tu pire edi dithsima? Wa nwinemo aye nanenthzi nemuna yenthzi yoihe.”<verse eid="JHN 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 4:13" />Yesu wa mu tawire ci: “Munu yomuhe o ku nwa aa meyu kenge a ku fa dinotwa karo, <verse eid="JHN 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 4:14" />unone yomuhe o ku nwa meyu o ku mu pa ame mbera ka a fu karo dinotwa, inene meyu aa na ku mu pa kenge a ku piruka ku kwenthzi dinowa dyo meyu o kukana ku pwerera, o ku pupera ku mwoyo o diyere.”<verse eid="JHN 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 4:15" />Oyo mbuyama wa mu amberire ci: “Ñathsire wange, ngo ni peko oko ku meyu ci mbera na ku fa dinotwa karo, ni thsie no ku na vetanga meyu kuno.”<verse eid="JHN 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 4:16" />Yesu wa mu amberire ci: “O thze o kethse munu woe, wangu o ka huke kuno.”<verse eid="JHN 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 4:17" />Oyo mbuyama wa tawire ci: “Ka ni di no munuwange.” Yesu wa mu amberire ci: “Wa amba yoshemwa yo ku ninga ci ko di no munuwoe, <verse eid="JHN 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 4:18" />inene akwerume mutanu a ku yekire, oyu o di nenthzi pano kadi cingwa munu woe. Eyi o na amba ya shemwa.”<verse eid="JHN 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 4:19" />Oya mbuyama wa mu amberire ci: “Ñathsire wange, naa mona ci o mukwakukethza owe. <verse eid="JHN 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 4:20" />Akwathsañuruetu a romberangire Nyambi po uno mukinya, uno honi amwe mwa Majuda mwaa ninga ci mu Yerusalema mo tu na roera ku mu rombera.”<verse eid="JHN 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 4:21" />Yesu wa mu amberire ci: “Owe o mbuyama, o tawe eyi ni ku ambera. Thsikati thsaa keya ethsi mwa ku kana ku rombera Tata po uno mukinya nji mu Yerusalema. <verse eid="JHN 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 4:22" />Amwe mwa Masamaria ka mu dimuka oyu mu rombera. Atwe twa Majuda tu na dimuka oyu tu rombera, inene kuyoyithsiwa kwaa tunderera ku Majuda. <verse eid="JHN 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 4:23" />Unone thsikati thsaa keya mane thsi na kumu kare, akwakurombera o shemwa ou a ku rombera Tata ko mupepo noshemwa. Akwakurombera o kengeyo wodiyo a fota Tata ci a mu rombere. <verse eid="JHN 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 4:24" />Nyambi po Mupepo, mweyo, awa mu rombera aa roera ku mu rombera ko mupepo noshemwa.”<verse eid="JHN 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 4:25" />Oya mbuyama wa mu amberire ci: “Ni na dimuka ci Mesiya oyu nethsiwa Krisitu aa keya. Ou a ku keya kenge a ku na tu tongonwena enu yoihe.”<verse eid="JHN 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 4:26" />Yesu wa mu amberire ci: “Yame, oyu o ambaura noe.”<verse eid="JHN 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 4:27" />Popo erongwa yenthzi ya kumine, ya komokire ku na mu wana o ku ambaura no mbuyama. Unone kwithsa oyu wa mwipurire ci: “Ine eyi o fota ku kwenthzi?” nji ci “Ine eyi o ambawera nenthzi?” <verse eid="JHN 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 4:28" />Oya mbuyama wa thsiire kafuma kenthzi no ku huka mu mbongi ku ka tongwera anu ci: <verse eid="JHN 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 4:29" />“Mu keye na mu mone munu oyu na ni tongwera yoihe eyi na tenda. Ene kenge nga ikara ci yodiyo Mesiya nji?” <verse eid="JHN 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 4:30" />Anu a kungurukire mu mbongi ku thza kwa Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 4:31" />Kethsiya thsikati erongwa yenthzi ya mu ooterire ci: “Murongithsi, o dye tango!” <verse eid="JHN 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 4:32" />Unone aye wa i tawire ci: “Ame po ni di nedya yo ku dya eyi mu na kana ku dimuka amwe.”<verse eid="JHN 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 4:33" />Erongwa ya cipurire ci: “Ene kwaa di oyu na mu retera edya nji?”<verse eid="JHN 4:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 4:34" />Yesu wa i amberire ci: “Edya yange po ku tenda eshima ya Nyambi oyu naa ni tumu no ku mana ekwama yenthzi eyi naa ni pa. <verse eid="JHN 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 4:35" />Mu na dimuka diambo dyo ku ninga ci: ‘Ku na thsiara maonda ane ci thsikati thso ku cora thsi kume.’ Unone ame naa mi ambera ci mu kambure meho enu no ku mona makanda. Edya i na pi, thsikati thso ku cora thsi na kumu. <verse eid="JHN 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 4:36" />Mukwakucora aa horithsiwa no ku kongwera mwoyo o diyere dicora, ci mukwakukuna na mukwakucora a nyanyukere pofoci. <verse eid="JHN 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 4:37" />Inene edi diambo dya shemwa dyo ku ninga ci: ‘Oyu aa kuna, oyu aa cora.’ <verse eid="JHN 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 4:38" />Na mi tumine ku ka cora dikanda edi mwa kana ku dima, edi a dimine anuawo amwe mwaa na wanenapo pekwama yo.”<verse eid="JHN 4:38" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Masamaria owangi aa tawa</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 4:39" />Masamaria owangi omo mu mbongi a tawire kwa Yesu pakuninga ci oya mbuyama wa pire ombangi ci: “Na ni tongwera eyi na tenda yoihe.” <verse eid="JHN 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 4:40" />Mweyo, Masamaria ou a na kumine ku kwenthzi, a mu rombire ci ekareno, ngou ekarireno mayuwa edi. <verse eid="JHN 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 4:41" />Mukaci ko maywi enthzi, owangi amweya karo a tawire ku kwenthzi. <verse eid="JHN 4:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 4:42" />A amberire oya mbuyama ci: “Ka tu tawire honi mukaci keyi o na tu tongwera pohuma, unone tu na na u ciyuvera twathsinda. Pano honi tu na dimuka ci yodiyo shemwa Muyoyithsi o kaye.”<verse eid="JHN 4:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa porithsa mwana nduna</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 4:43" />Munyima thzo kwikara mayuwa edi, Yesu wa tundiremo ku thza ku Galilea. <verse eid="JHN 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 4:44" />Yesu aye shemwa wa ambire ci: “Mukwakukethza ka a remekiwa mu ditunga dyenthzi.” <verse eid="JHN 4:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 4:45" />Ou a ka kumine mu Galilea, anu o mu Galilea a ka mu tamburire nawa, inene a ka monine yoihe eyi a ka kwamine mu Yerusalema pa thsidika thso Paseka, pakuninga ci nawo shime aa thzako.<verse eid="JHN 4:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 4:46" />Yesu wa thzire karo ku Kana o mu Galilea kuya a ka pirurire meyu waine. Kwekarire nduna o mukuru o kutumina oyu wekarire no mwanenthzi o mukwerumeana oyu wa korire mu Kapenauma. <verse eid="JHN 4:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 4:47" />Oyu mukwerume ou a yuvire ci Yesu na ka huka mu Galilea ku ka tunda ku Judea, wa thzire ku kwenthzi no ku ka mu adikanena ci a keye ku Kapenauma na a mu porithsere mwanenthzi oyu wa kokangerire.<verse eid="JHN 4:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 4:48" />Yesu wa mu amberire ci: “Ku kwenu po kwithsa oyu mbo tawa shime o ku na mono emonithso nekomokithsa.” <verse eid="JHN 4:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 4:49" />Oyo nduna o kutumina wa mu amberire ci: “Ñathsire wange, tu thzenu pano a shime ku fa mwanange.”<verse eid="JHN 4:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 4:50" />Yesu wa mu amberire ci: “O thze, mwanoe kenge a yoya!” Oya mukwerume wa tawire maywi a Yesu, ayepo thza.<verse eid="JHN 4:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 4:51" />O ku di mu dikuñwa, a mu shambawerire angambenthzi no ku mu tongwera ci: “Mwanoe muyumi!” <verse eid="JHN 4:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 4:52" />Ngou a wepurire thsikati ethsi a tatekire ku ciyuva nawa. A mu amberire ci: “Yana diyuwa o ku di na thsiuruka, po na di mu pwera dihokoma.” <verse eid="JHN 4:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 4:53" />Tata wa mwanuke wa vurukire ci thsodiyo shemwa thsikati a mu amberire Yesu ci: “Mwanoe kenge a yoya!” Aye no mwanda wenthzi ouhe a tawire kwa Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 4:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 4:54" />Ethsi thsodiyo thsimonithso thso muthsidi ethsi a kwamine Yesu o ku na ka huka mu Galilea ku ka tunda ku Judea.<verse eid="JHN 4:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JHN 5" />
  <para style="rem">TA, TC, CC, HS, CT2, TA, BM</para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa porithsa munu o thsikunga ku kayoano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 5:1" />Munyima thzeyi, kwekarire thsidika thso Majuda, Yesu wa kambamine ku thza ku Yerusalema. <verse eid="JHN 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 5:2" />Mu Yerusalema mo ka di kayoano po pepi no Thsero thzo Mangu, aka ka nethsiwa mu Thsiheveru<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nji ci Thsiaramaiki.</char></note> ci Betesida.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Betisaida.</char></note> Aka kayoano ka di no makeke o mutanu. <verse eid="JHN 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 5:3" />Mungi wanu wakwakukora, tupuputwa, ekunga nakwakuara shime a rarangire pa madidi o mu makeke [ku taterera meyu ci a herathzoke. <verse eid="JHN 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 5:4" />Thsikati no thsikati kangeru ka Fumu shime ka na heraurangire meyu, munu yomuhe o kutanga ku kumamo wa porithsiwire kwikora yenthzi.]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka thzi di mu mañoro o kutanga.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 5:5" />Mu kaciko kwekarire mukwerume yumweya oyu wa korire mu myaka thzo 38. <verse eid="JHN 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 5:6" />Yesu ou a mu monine o ku na rara apo no ku dimuka ci shime a korire myaka thzothzingi, wa mwipurire ci: “Ene waa fota ci o pore nji?”<verse eid="JHN 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 5:7" />Mwethzi wa tawire ci: “Ñathsire wange, ka ni di noyu o ku ni paka mu kayoano meyu o ku a na herauriwa. Yoihe ni ninga ci ni thzemo, yumweya aa tanga ku ka kumamo ame o ku ni shime.”<verse eid="JHN 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 5:8" />Yesu wa mu amberire ci: “O katuke, o shimbe kanaha koe o ende!” <verse eid="JHN 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 5:9" />Popo oya mukwerume wa porire, wa shimbire kanaha kenthzi no ku enda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 5:9">Eyi shime ya tendaharire mu diyuwa dyo Savata, <verse eid="JHN 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 5:10" />mweyo, aendithsi o Majuda a amberire oya mukwerume wa porithsiwire ci: “Rero po diyuwa dyo Savata, murao ka u tawethzire ci o pangeke kanaha koe.”<verse eid="JHN 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 5:11" />Unone aye wa tawire ci: “Oyu na ni porithsa yo na ni ambera ci: ‘O shimbe kanaha koe o ende.’ ”<verse eid="JHN 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 5:12" />A mwipurire ci: “Edye oyo munu na ku ambera ci o shimbe kanaha koe o ende?” <verse eid="JHN 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 5:13" />Uno honi oya mukwerume wa porithsiwire ka a dimukire ci nedi edye wa mu porithsire, pakuninga ci Yesu shime a verukire mu kaci ko mbunga thzothzikuru. <verse eid="JHN 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 5:14" />Munyima, Yesu wa mu wanine mu Tembere, ayepo mu ambera ci: “O mone, o nekara nawa honi, mbera wa tenda thsivi karo, ngeci kadi kengeyo thsinu thsothsimango kupiterera kenge thsa ku tendahara ku koe.” <verse eid="JHN 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 5:15" />Oya mukwerume ngou a thzire no ku ka tongwera aendithsi o Majuda ci nedi Yesu wa mu porithsire.<verse eid="JHN 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa amba ci yodiyo Mwana Nyambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 5:16" />Mweyo, pakuninga ci Yesu shime a kwamine eyi mu diyuwa dyo Savata, Majuda a tatekire ku mu nyandithsa. <verse eid="JHN 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 5:17" />Unone Yesu wa wa tawire ci: “Tata po aa kwama thsikati thsothsihe shime ku na kuma no thsino thsikati, name naa kwama.” <verse eid="JHN 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 5:18" />Mukaci keyi, Majuda a fotire dyo ku mwipaa, inene ka a corire pohuma murao o diyuwa dyo Savata, unone shime ethsire karo Nyambi ci Tata wenthzi shemwa, ku monithsa ci aa cishoka na Nyambi.<verse eid="JHN 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 5:19" />Yesu ngou a wa tawire ci: “Naa mi tongwera yoshemwa ci kwithsa ethsi nga a kwama Mwana kokoro wenthzi thsinda, unone aa tenda pohuma eyi a mona kwa Tata wenthzi o ku i tenda. Inene eyi a tenda Tata wenthzi no Mwana yodiyo a tenda. <verse eid="JHN 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 5:20" />Inene Tata wa ku shima Mwana karo aa mu monithsa yoihe eyi a kwama. Karo kenge a ku mu monithsa yoikuru nene kupita eyi, ci nga mwa ku i cinjembukere. <verse eid="JHN 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 5:21" />Inene dyodi a pindura Tata afu no ku wa pa mwoyo, no Mwana dya a na pa mwoyo kowa a na foto ku u pa. <verse eid="JHN 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 5:22" />Tata ka a raturire munu, uno honi naa pa Mwana okoro ouhe o ku ratura, <verse eid="JHN 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 5:23" />ci anu wahe nga a remeke Mwana eci edi a remeka Tata. Yomuhe o kukana ku remeka Mwana ka a remekire Tata oyu naa mu tumu.<verse eid="JHN 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 5:24" />“Naa mi tongwera yoshemwa ci yomuhe o ku yuva maywi ange, no ku tawa koyu naa ni tumu o di no mwoyo o diyere. Mbera ka raturiwa, inene naa para ku kufa no ku wana mwoyo.<verse eid="JHN 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 5:25" />“Naa mi tongwera yoshemwa ci thsikati thsaa keya, mane thsi na kumu kare, ou a ku yuva afu diywi dya Mwana Nyambi. Karo awa ku di yuva kenge a ku yoya. <verse eid="JHN 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 5:26" />Inene dyodi a di Tata no mwoyo mu mwenthzi, dyo naa pa no Mwana kwikara no mwoyo mu mwenthzi thsinda. <verse eid="JHN 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 5:27" />Karo naa mu pa okoro o ku ratura munu yomuhe, pakuninga ci yodiyo Mwana Munu. <verse eid="JHN 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 5:28" />Mwa i komoka, inene thsikati thsaa keya afu wahe awa a di mu mararo ou a ku yuva diywi dyenthzi <verse eid="JHN 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 5:29" />no ku tundamo. Awa na tende yoiwa a ku pindukere mwoyo o diyere, unone awa na tende yoimango a ku pindukere raturo.<verse eid="JHN 5:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ombangi keyi ya Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 5:30" />“Kwithsa ethsi nga ni kwama kokoro wange nothsinda. Naa ratura dyodi ni yuva kwa Nyambi. Mweyo, raturo thzange thza kuoroka, inene ka ni erekire ku kwama eshima yange unone eshima yoyu na a ni tumu. <verse eid="JHN 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 5:31" />Ngeci naa pa ombangi keyi yange ame nothsinda, ombangi wange ka wa ku tamburiwa ci wa shemwa. <verse eid="JHN 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 5:32" />Unone kwaa di oyu pa ombangi keyi yange, karo ni na dimuka ci yoihe eyi a amba keyi yange yashemwa. <verse eid="JHN 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 5:33" />Mwa tumine anu kwa Johani ku ka mu teerera, karo ombangi wenthzi keyi yange nedi wa shemwa. <verse eid="JHN 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 5:34" />Kadi cingwa naa fota ombangi o munu, unone naa amba eyi ci mu yoyithsiwe. <verse eid="JHN 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 5:35" />Johani wa cipiturire eci kambarambara aka ka yuuma no ku muneka, karo mwa nyanyukerire mwethzi wenthzi mu thsikati thsothsipu.<verse eid="JHN 5:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 5:36" />“Uno honi ni di nombangi oukuru kupita wa Johani. Inene ekwama eyi naa ni pa Tata ci ni i mane, yodiyo shemwa ekwama eyi ni kwama, karo yaa monithsa ci Tata naa ni tumu. <verse eid="JHN 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 5:37" />Tata oyu naa ni tumu aa pa ombangi keyi yange aye thsinda. Mwa diyerire ku yuva diywi dyenthzi nji ku mona thsihanga thsenthzi. <verse eid="JHN 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 5:38" />Diywi dyenthzi ka di di mu micima thzenu, inene ka mu tawire koyu naa tumu.<verse eid="JHN 5:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 5:39" />“Mwaa fotithsithsa nawa mu Mañoro, inene mwaa anekera ci kenge mu wanamo mwoyo o diyere. Karo aa Mañoro aa pa ombangi keyi yange! <verse eid="JHN 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 5:40" />Uno honi mwaa kana ku keya ku kwange ci mu wane mwoyo.<verse eid="JHN 5:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 5:41" />“Ka ni fotire ku remekiwa kwanu, <verse eid="JHN 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 5:42" />inene ni na dimuka ci mu micima thzenu ka mu shimine shemwa Nyambi. <verse eid="JHN 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 5:43" />Na ni keya mu dithzina dya Tata, uno honi ka mu ni tamburire. Unone ngeci yumweya waa ku keye mu dithzina dyenthzi aye thsinda, kenge mwa ku mu tambura ko thsinyanyu. <verse eid="JHN 5:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 5:44" />Ngepi nga mu tawa, amwe mu tambura direma kwamweya, uno honi ka mu fotire direma edi di tunda ku kwenthzi aye Nyambi yofoci.<verse eid="JHN 5:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 5:45" />“Mwa anekera ci kenge na ku mi thzekithsa kwa Tata. Oyu wa ku mi thzekithsa po Mushe oyu mu na kurupera. <verse eid="JHN 5:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 5:46" />Inene nga shime mwa tawire shemwa kwa Mushe, nga mu na tawa noku ku kwange, inene shime a ñorire keyi yange. <verse eid="JHN 5:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 5:47" />Uno honi ngeci ka mu tawire eyi a ñorire ne, ngepi nga mu tawa eyi ni mi ambera?”<verse eid="JHN 5:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JHN 6" />
  <para style="rem">TA, TC, CC, HS, CT2, TA, BM</para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aekutithsa anu o 5,000</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Mat 14.13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Mar 6.30-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luk 9.10-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 6:1" />Munyima thzeyi, Yesu wa yavukire ku thza mu thsambwadiya thzo Diviya dya Galilea, edi di nethsiwa karo ci Diviya dya Tiberiya. <verse eid="JHN 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 6:2" />Mbunga thzothzingi thza mu shupwerire, inene a monine emonithso eyi a kwamine yo ku porithsa akwakukora. <verse eid="JHN 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 6:3" />Yesu ngou a thzinine pa mukinya no ku kekara pashi nerongwa yenthzi. <verse eid="JHN 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 6:4" />Thsidika thso Majuda ethsi thsi nethsiwa Paseka thsekarire po pepi no ku tendahara. <verse eid="JHN 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 6:5" />Yesu ou a kamburire meho no ku mona mbunga thzothzikuru o ku thzi keya ku kwenthzi, wa amberire Filipu ci: “Kupi oku nga tu twethsa ku ura edya yo ku pa wahe awa anu?” <verse eid="JHN 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 6:6" />Shime a ambire kengeyo ku mu ereka, inene aye wa dimukire eyi nga a kwamine.<verse eid="JHN 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 6:7" />Filipu wa tawire ci: “Shaanga madi o mihorero thzo maonda mutanu na edi tumba nga a uru edya yo ku ninga ci munu no munu kukwo a dye shaanga kokapu.”<figure style="fig" alt="5 barley loaves and 2 fishes" file="gt00094b.tif" size="col" loc="Jhn 6: 7-12" copy="Gordon" ref="6.7-12">Makende o mutanu no thsi thzidi</figure><verse eid="JHN 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 6:8" />Thsimweya kwirongwa yenthzi, Andereasi mina Simoni Peturu wa mu amberire ci: <verse eid="JHN 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 6:9" />“Pa a di pano mukwerumeana oyu di no makende o mutanu no tuthsi totuonye twidi. Uno honi, ine nga i kwathsa ethzi mbunga thzi kuma apa.”<verse eid="JHN 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 6:10" />Yesu wa ambire ci: “Mwikarithse anu pashi.” Ngou ekarire wahe pashi pa mwenge. Akwerumeko pohuma a fotire ku kwana 5,000. <verse eid="JHN 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 6:11" />Yesu ngou a shimbire ao makende, wa kandererire kwa Nyambi no ku a era anu. Munyima thzeyo, wa tendire kengeyo no ku thsi. Yesu wa wa pire momuhe omu a foterire. <verse eid="JHN 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 6:12" />Anu wahe ou ekutire, Yesu wa amberire erongwa yenthzi ci: “Mungere omwamwaethzi ou u na thsiarapo ci kwekara eyi i cipera.” <verse eid="JHN 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 6:13" />Ngou a u toratorire no ku yarithsa mayongo o dikumi na edi omwamwaethzi ou a thsiirepo awaya a dire aya makende o mutanu.<verse eid="JHN 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 6:14" />Anu ou a monine ethso thsimonithso a kwamine, a ambire ci: “Yoshemwa oyu yodiyo mukwakukethza oyu na roera ku keya mu kaye.” <verse eid="JHN 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 6:15" />Yesu ou a monine ci anu shime a fotire ku mu ootera ci ekare fumu wo, wa tuturukerire karo ku mukinya yofoci.<verse eid="JHN 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa enda pa meyu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:22-33">Mat 14.22-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:45-52">Mar 6.45-52</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 6:16" />Runguro erongwa yenthzi ya thzire ku diviya. <verse eid="JHN 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 6:17" />Unone ou peraurire pashi Yesu kadi wa ku na kuma, ya yomamine mu wato no ku hunyuna ku yavuka diviya ku thza ku Kapenauma. <verse eid="JHN 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 6:18" />Kwekarire mañithsingi mu diviya mukaci ko dyungu dyodikuru edi dya ngundungire. <verse eid="JHN 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 6:19" />Ou ya vuire tunano to ku twethsa ku kwana mutanu nji mutanu na kofoci, ya monine Yesu o ku kokera ku wato o ku enda pa meyu, ayopo i yapa nene. <verse eid="JHN 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 6:20" />Unone wa i amberire ci: “Mwa yapa, yame.” <verse eid="JHN 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 6:21" />Ya nyanyukire nene ku mu yomeka mu wato, popo wato wa thsekerire pa dikambo apa ya thzire.<verse eid="JHN 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu yodiyo dikende dyo mwoyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 6:22" />Diyuwa edi dya randireko anu awa a thsiarire pa thsambwadiya thzo diviya a nangurire ci shime wato ofoci wekarireko, unone Yesu ka a yomamineno mu wato, erongwa yenthzi shime ya thzire yofoci. <verse eid="JHN 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 6:23" />Mato amweya aa a tundire ku diumbo edi di nethsiwa Tiberiya a na kumine po pepi nopa a dyererire makende, Fumu ou a manine ku kanderera. <verse eid="JHN 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 6:24" />Awo anu awo ou a monine ci Yesu nerongwa yenthzi kekarireko, a yomamine mu mato no ku yavuka ku ka fotaura Yesu mu Kapenauma.<verse eid="JHN 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 6:25" />Ou a ka mu wanine mu thsambwadiya thzo diviya a mwipurire ci: “Murongithsi, diyuwa dipi no keya kuno?” <verse eid="JHN 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 6:26" />Yesu wa wa tawire ci: “Naa mi tongwera yoshemwa ci ka mu ni fotawerire mukaci ko kuninga ci na mu mono emonithso, unone mwaa ni fotaura pakuninga ci na mu di makende no kwikuta. <verse eid="JHN 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 6:27" />Mwa kwamena edya yo ku twethsa kwipa, unone mu kwamene edya yo kukana kwipa karo yo ku pa mwoyo o diyere, eyi a ku mi pa Mwana Munu. Inene Nyambi Tata na a mu paka thsitamba thsenthzi.”<verse eid="JHN 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 6:28" />Ngou a mwipurire ci: “Ine tu na roera ku tenda ci tu kwame ekwama ya Nyambi?” <verse eid="JHN 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 6:29" />Yesu wa wa tawire ci: “Thsikwama ethsi a fota Nyambi ci mu thsi kwame po ethsi, mu tawe koyu naa tumu.” <verse eid="JHN 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 6:30" />A tawire ci: “Thsimonithso mwine nga o tu monithsa ci nga tu tawe ku koe? Ine o kwama? <verse eid="JHN 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 6:31" />Akwathsañuruetu a dire maana mu dikunguthsitu eci edi i na ñoriwa ci: ‘Wa wa pire makende o ku tunda ku wiru ci a dye<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 16:4">Diya 16.4</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 16:15">15</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 78:24">Mem 78.24</ref>.</char></note>.’ ”<verse eid="JHN 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 6:32" />Yesu wa wa tawire ci: “Naa mi tongwera yoshemwa ci kadi cingwa Mushe oyu wa mi pire makende o ku tunda ku wiru, unone Tata yodiyo oyu mi pa dikende dyo shemwa dyo ku tunda ku wiru. <verse eid="JHN 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 6:33" />Inene dikende dya Nyambi po oyu wa tunda ku wiru no ku pa kaye mwoyo.” <verse eid="JHN 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 6:34" />A mu amberire ci: “Ñathsire wetu, o tu pange kwedyo dikende thsikati thsothsihe.” <verse eid="JHN 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 6:35" />Yesu wa wa tawire ci: “Yame no dikende dyo mwoyo, yomuhe o ku keya ku kwange mbera ka a fu nthzara, karo yomuhe o ku tawa ku kwange mbera ka a fu dinotwa.<verse eid="JHN 6:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 6:36" />“Uno honi na ni mi ambera ci mu na ni mono, unone kadi mwakwa ku tawa ku kwange. <verse eid="JHN 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 6:37" />Wahe awa naa ni pa Tata kenge a ku keya ku kwange karo yomuhe o ku keya ku kwange mbera ka ni mu cithzi. <verse eid="JHN 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 6:38" />Inene na ni shiruka ku keya pashi ku tunda ku wiru ku na kwama eshima yoyu naa ni tumu, kadi eshima yange. <verse eid="JHN 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 6:39" />Eyi yodiyo eshima yoyu naa ni tumu, ci na ku yawa shaanga yofoci powa naa ni pa, unone naa roera ku wa pindura kwafu mu diyuwa dyo mahurerero. <verse eid="JHN 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 6:40" />Inene eyi po yeshima ya Tata ci wahe o ku mona Mwana no ku tawa ku kwenthzi mba wane mwoyo o diyere. Kenge na ku wa pindura mu diyuwa dyo mahurerero.”<verse eid="JHN 6:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 6:41" />Majuda ngou a tatekire ku shonaura, inene shime a ambire ci: “Yame no dikende edi na di tundu ku wiru.” <verse eid="JHN 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 6:42" />A ambire ci: “Ene ka di yodiyo Yesu oyu mwana Josefa? Tu na dimuka tata wenthzi no mama wenthzi. Ngepi honi nga a amba ci aa tunda ku wiru?”<verse eid="JHN 6:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 6:43" />Unone Yesu wa wa tawire ci: “Mu thsie ku shonaura mukaci keyi ni na amba. <verse eid="JHN 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 6:44" />Kwithsa munu o ku twethsa ku keya ku kwange shime ngeci Tata oyu naa ni tumu aa mu kokera ku kwange karo kenge na ku mu pindura kwafu mu diyuwa dyo mahurerero. <verse eid="JHN 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 6:45" />Akwakukethza a ñorire ci: ‘Wahe kenge a ku wa rongithsa Nyambi.’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.45 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 54:13">Isa 54.13</ref>.</char></note> Yomuhe o ku yuva Tata no ku cirongithsa ku kwenthzi aa keya ku kwange.<verse eid="JHN 6:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 6:46" />“Kadi cingwa kwaa di oyu wa mona po Tata, shime aye oyu naa tundu kwa Nyambi, yodiyo pohuma naa mono Tata.<verse eid="JHN 6:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 6:47" />“Naa mi tongwera yoshemwa ci yomuhe o ku tawa o di no mwoyo o diyere. <verse eid="JHN 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 6:48" />Yame no dikende dyo mwoyo. <verse eid="JHN 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 6:49" />Akwathsañuruenu a dire maana mu dikunguthsitu, uno honi a fire. <verse eid="JHN 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 6:50" />Dino po dyodiyo dikende dyo ku tunda ku wiru, yomuhe o ku dyako mbera ka a fu. <verse eid="JHN 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 6:51" />Yame no dikende edi di yoya edi na di tundu ku wiru. Yomuhe o ku dya kodi dikende kenge a ku yoya diyere. Edi dikende na ku pa ci kaye ka yoye po erama yange.”<verse eid="JHN 6:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 6:52" />Majuda a tatekire ku cikananithsa mu kaciko no ku cipura ci: “Ngepi nga a tu pa erama yenthzi oyu munu ci tu i dye?”<verse eid="JHN 6:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 6:53" />Yesu ngou a wa amberire ci: “Naa mi tongwera yoshemwa ci shime ci mu dye erama yange ame no Mwana Munu no ku nwa onyinga wange, tumba nga mu wana mwoyo o diyere. <verse eid="JHN 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 6:54" />Unone yomuhe o ku dya erama yange no ku nwa onyinga wange o di no mwoyo o diyere karo kenge na ku mu pindura kwafu mu diyuwa dyo mahurerero. <verse eid="JHN 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 6:55" />Inene erama yange po edya shemwa nonyinga wange enwa shemwa. <verse eid="JHN 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 6:56" />Yomuhe o ku dya erama yange no ku nwa onyinga wange aa yoya mu mwange name naa yoya mu mwenthzi. <verse eid="JHN 6:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 6:57" />Naa yoya mukaci ko kuninga ci Tata oyu naa ni tumu aa yoya. Mweyo, yomuhe o ku dya erama yange kenge a ku yoya naye mukaci kange. <verse eid="JHN 6:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 6:58" />Dino dyodiyo dikende edi na di tundu ku wiru. Ka di cishokire eci maana oyu a dire akwathsañuruenu, unone a fire. Uno honi yomuhe o ku dya dino dikende kenge a ku yoya diyere.”<verse eid="JHN 6:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 6:59" />Yesu wa ambire eyi o ku rongithsa mu sinagoge thzo mu Kapenauma.<verse eid="JHN 6:59" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Maywi o mwoyo o diyere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="JHN 6:60" />Ongi werongwa yenthzi ou ya yuvire eyo, yaa ambire ci: “Eyi erongithsa po ikaru nene, edye o ku twethsa ku i yuvithsithsa?”<verse eid="JHN 6:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="JHN 6:61" />Unone Yesu pa ku dimuka ci erongwa yenthzi shime ya shonaurire mukaci keyo, wa i amberire ci: “Ene i na mi pithsera eyi nji? <verse eid="JHN 6:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="JHN 6:62" />Ngepi nga i dikara ci mu mone Mwana Munu o ku thzina mu wiru omu ekarire pa kutanga? <verse eid="JHN 6:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="JHN 6:63" />Oyu na panga mwoyo po Mupepo, nyama tumba thzi twethsa. Maywi aa ni na mi ambera po a Mupepo no mwoyo. <verse eid="JHN 6:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="JHN 6:64" />Unone amweya ku kwenu ka tawire.” (Inene ku tunda ku matatekero Yesu wa dimukire awa kanine ku tawa, karo wa dimukire ci edye wa ku mu omba). <verse eid="JHN 6:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="JHN 6:65" />Ngou a i amberire ci: “Eyi ngeyi na mi amberire ci kwithsa o ku twethsa ku keya ku kwange shime ci a i mu pe Tata.”<verse eid="JHN 6:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="JHN 6:66" />Munyima thzeyo, ongi werongwa yenthzi ya hukire munyima no ku thsia ku mu shupwera. <verse eid="JHN 6:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="JHN 6:67" />Yesu ngou a thsiurukerire kowaya o dikumi naidi no ku wepura ci: “Amwe ne kenge mu thsia namwe ku ni shupwera nji?” <verse eid="JHN 6:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="JHN 6:68" />Simoni Peturu wa tawire ci: “Fumu, kwadye oku nga tu thza? Yowe o di no maywi o ku pa mwoyo o diyere.<verse eid="JHN 6:68" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="JHN 6:69" />“Tu na tawa karo tu na dimuka ci yowe O Shokenu wa Nyambi.” <verse eid="JHN 6:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="JHN 6:70" />Yesu wa ambire ci: “Ene kadi yame na ni mi hangura amwe mwakwa dikumi naidi nji? Uno honi yofoci ku kwenu po shamaonga.” <verse eid="JHN 6:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="JHN 6:71" />Shime a ambire ya Judasi mwana Simoni Isikariota. Judasi nedi yumweya owaya o dikumi naidi, oyu wa mu ombire.<verse eid="JHN 6:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JHN 7" />
  <para style="rem">TA, TC, CC, HS, CT2, TA, BM</para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu naminenthzi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 7:1" />Munyima thzeyo, Yesu wa thzire o pitapita mu Galilea. Ka a fotire kwikara mu Judea, inene Majuda shime a fotire ku mwipaa. <verse eid="JHN 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 7:2" />Diyuwa dyo thsidika thso Majuda ethsi thsi nethsiwa Thsidika thsErombo o ku thsi di po pepi no ku tendahara, <verse eid="JHN 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 7:3" />amina Yesu a mu amberire ci: “O tunde muno o thze ku Judea ci erongwa yoe nayo i ka mone ekwama eyi o kwama. <verse eid="JHN 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 7:4" />Inene kwithsa o ku horeka ekwama yenthzi ngeci aye o ku fota ci nga na yuku. Edi i di ci waa twethsa ku kwama enu yo kengeyo, o hokoke kwanu wahe ci a ku dimuke mu kaye.” <verse eid="JHN 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 7:5" />Inene shaanga aminenthzi ka tawire ku kwenthzi.<verse eid="JHN 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 7:6" />Yesu wa wa amberire ci: “Thsikati thsange thsi shime ku kuma. Uno honi amwe thsikati thsothsihe thsi di nawa. <verse eid="JHN 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 7:7" />Kaye tumba ka thzimbi amwe, unone aa thzimba ame mukaci ko ku ninga ci naa pa ombangi ci etenda yo imango. <verse eid="JHN 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 7:8" />Amwe mu thze ku thsidika. Ame ka ni thziko oku ku thsidika, inene thsikati thsange thsi shime ku kuma.” <verse eid="JHN 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 7:9" />Yesu ou a manine ku amba eyi, wa thsiarire mu Galilea.<verse eid="JHN 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa thza ku thsidika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 7:10" />Amina Yesu ou a thzire oko ku thsidika, Yesu naye wa thzireko, kadi ko ku cimonaharithsa unone ku mukunda. <verse eid="JHN 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 7:11" />Majuda shime a fotafotire Yesu pa thsidika no ku thza o wipaura ci: “Kupi a di?” <verse eid="JHN 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 7:12" />Kwekarire kuyaayaaya kokungi mu mbunga keyi yenthzi. Amweya ci: “Oyu po munu o muwawa.” Awa ci: “Ya kwithsa, aa pambanithsa anu oyu.” <verse eid="JHN 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 7:13" />Unone kwithsa oyu wa ambire yenthzi ko ku cimonaharithsa mukaci ko ku yapa Majuda.<verse eid="JHN 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 7:14" />Thsidika ou thsa kumine pa kaci, Yesu wa kambamine ku thza ku Tembere no ku ka tateka ku rongithsa anu. <verse eid="JHN 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 7:15" />Majuda a komokire no ku amba ci: “Oyu munu ne aa i dimuka ngepi eyi, inene ka a cirongithsa?”<verse eid="JHN 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 7:16" />Yesu ngou a wa tawire ci: “Erongithsa yange po kadi yange, unone yaa tunda koyu naa ni tumu. <verse eid="JHN 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 7:17" />Munu yomuhe o ku fota ku kwama eshima ya Nyambi, kenge a ku dimuka ngeci erongithsa yange yaa tunda kwa Nyambi nji naa i kwama kokoro wange. <verse eid="JHN 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 7:18" />Munu o ku amba kokoro wenthzi thsinda po aa fota ku shangariwa, uno honi oyu fota ci ku shangariwe oyu naa mu tumu aye wa ku amba yoshemwa karo tumba angera. <verse eid="JHN 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 7:19" />Ene Mushe kadi shime a mi pire murao? Uno honi kwithsa shaanga yofoci ku kwenu oyu na u hengeka. Ine eyi mu fotera ku nipaa?”<verse eid="JHN 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 7:20" />Mbunga thza tawire ci: “O di no muthzimu! Edye na foto ku kwipaa?”<verse eid="JHN 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 7:21" />Yesu wa wa tawire ci: “Na ni tende thsikomokithsa thsofoci dyo Savata, karo shime mwaa i komoka mwahe! <verse eid="JHN 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 7:22" />Mushe shime a mi raererire ku twaranga anenu wakwerumeana ku mukanda (shaanga ikare ci kadi yodiyo wa i tatekire, unone akwathsañuruenu wodiyo a i tatekire). Mane mwaa twaranga anenu wakwerumeana ku mukanda no mu diyuwa dyo Savata. <verse eid="JHN 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 7:23" />Ngeci amwe mwaa twaranga anenu wakwerumeana ku mukanda mu diyuwa dyo Savata ci murao wa Mushe wa coriwa, ine honi eyi mu ni anthzipera uno na ni porithsa munu erama yenthzi yoihe mu diyuwa dyo Savata? <verse eid="JHN 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 7:24" />Mwa ratura ko mumonaharero, unone mu rature komu ku na roera.”<verse eid="JHN 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ene Yesu ne yodiyo Mesiya nji?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 7:25" />Anu amweya o mu Yerusalema a ambire ci: “Ene kadi yodiyo oyu a fota kwipaa oyu? <verse eid="JHN 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 7:26" />Mu na mono, oyu pano a amba thsitonwameho ku mbunga, unone kwithsa eyi a na mu ambera. Ene awa aendithsi etu ne aa tawa shemwa ci yodiyo Mesiya nji? <verse eid="JHN 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 7:27" />Uno honi tu na dimuka oku a tunda oyu munu, unone Mesiya aye ou a ku keya, kwithsa oyu wa ku dimuka oku a tunda.”<verse eid="JHN 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 7:28" />Yesu o ku rongithsa kengeyo mu Tembere, wa tanarithsire ku diywi ku amba ci: “Ii, mu na ni dimuka nawa, karo mu na dimuka noku na tunda. Ka na ni keye kokoro wange nothsinda, unone oyu naa ni tumu po wa shemwa karo ka mu mu dimuka. <verse eid="JHN 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 7:29" />Unone ame ni na mu dimuka inene naa tunda ku kwenthzi, karo yodiyo naa ni tumu.” <verse eid="JHN 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 7:30" />Ngou a fotire ku mu kwata, unone kwithsa oyu wa mu pakire dyoko, inene thsikati thsenthzi ka thsa kumine.<verse eid="JHN 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 7:31" />Anu owangi a tawire ku kwenthzi. A ambire ci: “Shaanga ou a ku keya Mesiya ne kenge a ku na kwama emonithso yoingi kupita eyi naa kwama oyu munu nji?”<verse eid="JHN 7:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 7:32" />Afarithsi a yuvire mbunga o ku thzi yaaya eyi enu keyi ya Yesu. Akuru o mapurisita nAfarithsi ngou a tumine akwakunyunga Tembere ku ka kwata Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 7:33" />Yesu ngou a ambire ci: “Ni shime tango kwikara nenu thsikati thsothsipu, mbeci honi na ku thze koyu naa ni tumu. <verse eid="JHN 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 7:34" />Kenge mwa ku ni fotafota, unone ka mwa ku ni wana, inene oku na ku thza tumba mu twethsa ku kumako.”<verse eid="JHN 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 7:35" />Majuda a cipurire ci: “Kupi oku a fota ku thza oyu munu oku twa ku kana ku mu wana? Ene aa fota ku thza kwanuetu awa na panthzaanena ku Magerike ci a ka rongithse no Magerike nji? <verse eid="JHN 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 7:36" />Aa amba ine pa ku amba ci: ‘Kenge mwa ku ni fotafota, unone ka mwa ku ni wana,’ karo ci ‘Oku na ku thza tumba mu twethsa ku kumako!’ ”<verse eid="JHN 7:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Meyu o mwoyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 7:37" />Mu diyuwa dyo mamaneneno o thsidika, adyo dyoshokuru nene, Yesu wemanine no ku amba ko ku tanarithsa ku diywi ci: “Yomuhe oyu na fu dinotwa a keye ku kwange naa nwe. <verse eid="JHN 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 7:38" />Yomuhe o ku tawa ku kwange, mu mucima wenthzi kenge kwa ku pupa marware o meyu o ku pa mwoyo, eci edi ku na ñoriwa mu Mañoro.” <verse eid="JHN 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 7:39" />Apa Yesu shime a ambire yo Mupepo Oukenu, oyu a roerire ku tambura awa tawire ku kwenthzi. Kethsiya thsikati Mupepo o ku shime ku piwa, pakuninga ci Yesu o ku shime kwingena mu kutethzima.<verse eid="JHN 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 7:40" />Ou a yuvire o ku amba kengeyo, amweya kukwo a ambire ci: “Yoshemwa oyu munu yodiyo Mukwakukethza oyu na tatereriwa.” <verse eid="JHN 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 7:41" />Amweya a ningire ci: “Yodiyo Mesiya!” Unone awa amweya ci: “Mesiya ne kenge nga a tunderera mu Galilea nji? <verse eid="JHN 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 7:42" />Ene Mañoro ne ka a ambire ci Mesiya kenge a ku tunderera mu mukuta wa Davida no kwerekiwera mu Betelehema, mbongi omu a tungire Davida?” <verse eid="JHN 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 7:43" />Mweyo, kwekarire kucitepa mu mbunga mukaci ka Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 7:44" />Amweya a fotire ku mu kwata, unone kwithsa shaanga yofoci oyu wa mu pakire dyoko.<verse eid="JHN 7:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kukana kutawa ko Majuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 7:45" />Akwakunyunga Tembere a hukire kwakuru o mapurisita nAfarithsi, awo a wepurire ci: “Ine eyi mu na kana ku ka mu reta?”<verse eid="JHN 7:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 7:46" />Akwakunyunga a tawire ci: “Kwithsa munu oyu wa amba eci oya munu!”<verse eid="JHN 7:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 7:47" />Afarithsi epurire ci: “Ene namwe o na ka miangera?” <verse eid="JHN 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 7:48" />“Ene kwaa di kwaendithsietu nji kwAfarithsi shaanga yofoci oyu na tawa ku kwenthzi? <verse eid="JHN 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 7:49" />Uno honi ethzi mbunga thzo kukana ku dimuka murao na thzi kutiwa!”<verse eid="JHN 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 7:50" />Nikodema, yumweya o mu thsikwata thso, oya wa thzire kwa Yesu rumweya, ngou a ambire ci: <verse eid="JHN 7:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 7:51" />“Ene murao wetu ne waa tu tawethza ku ratura munu ko kukana ku tanga tango ku yuva no ku fotithsithsa eyi naa tende?”<verse eid="JHN 7:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 7:52" />A mu tawire ci: “Ene nowe waa tunda ku Galilea nji? O fotithsithse nawa kenge wa ku wana ci kwithsa mukwakukethza o ku tunderera ku Galilea.” <verse eid="JHN 7:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 7:53" />Ngou munu no munu a hukire ku nthzio thzenthzi.<verse eid="JHN 7:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JHN 8" />
  <para style="rem">TA, TC, CC, HS, CT2, TA, BM</para>
  <para style="s1">Mbuyama oyu wa kwatiwire mu mirembe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 8:1" />Uno honi Yesu wa thzire ku Mukinya wEtondo yo Miywera. <verse eid="JHN 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 8:2" />Mathsikuthsiku diyuwa o ku di va wa keyire karo ku Tembere. Anu wahe a keyire ku kwenthzi, wekarire pashi no ku tateka ku wa rongithsa. <verse eid="JHN 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 8:3" />Arongithsi o murao nAfarithsi a retire ku kwenthzi mbuyama oyu wa kwatiwire mu mirembe no ku na mwimeka mu kaci ko mbunga.<verse eid="JHN 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 8:4" />A amberire Yesu ci: “Murongithsi, oyu mbuyama na kwatiwa o ku rembeka. <verse eid="JHN 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 8:5" />Mu murao Mushe wa tu raererire ci mbuyama o mushovo o kengeyo aa roera kwipaiwa ko ku povauriwa ko mawe. Owe honi ne waa ambapo ine?”<verse eid="JHN 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 8:6" />Shime ambire eyi ku mu ta pa rudimi ci a wane po ku mu thzekithsera. Yesu wa kotamine no ku ñora pashi no munwe wenthzi. <verse eid="JHN 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 8:7" />Ou a kwatererire ku mwipaura mangudi Yesu wa kotokire no ku wa ambera ci: “Oyu wa kana ku tendapo thsivi mu kaci kenu ekare o kutanga ku mu kuha diwe.” <verse eid="JHN 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 8:8" />Wa kotamine karo no ku ñora pashi.<verse eid="JHN 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 8:9" />Ou a yuvire eyi, a tatekire ku thsevuka yofoci yofoci ku tatekera akuru. Ku hura Yesu wa thsiarire yofoci, noya mbuyama o ku nemana pa rupara rwenthzi. <verse eid="JHN 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 8:10" />Yesu ngou a kotokire no ku mwipura ci: “Mama, kupi a di waya a na ku thzekithsa?” O kwithsa oyu na thsiara ku ku thzekithsa?<verse eid="JHN 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 8:11" />Wa tawire ci: “Okwithsa, ñathsire wange.” Yesu ngou a ambire ci: “Name ka ni ku ratura. O thze, unone mbera wa tenda thsivi karo.”<verse eid="JHN 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu, aye mwethzi o kaye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 8:12" />Yesu wa wa amberire karo ci: “Yame no mwethzi o kaye. Yomuhe o ku ni shupwera mbera ka a ende mu mirema, unone kenge mba a wana mwethzi o mwoyo.”<verse eid="JHN 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 8:13" />Afarithsi ngou a mu amberire ci: “Waa pa ombangi woe yowe othsinda, ombangi woe kadi wa shemwa.”<verse eid="JHN 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 8:14" />Yesu wa tawire ci: “Shaanga yame ni pa ombangi wange nothsinda, eyi ni na amba po yashemwa. Inene ni na dimuka oku na ni tundu noku ni thza, uno honi amwe ka mu dimuka oku na ni tundu noku ni thza. <verse eid="JHN 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 8:15" />Amwe po mwaa ratura konu, ame ka ni raturangire munu. <verse eid="JHN 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 8:16" />Uno honi ngeci naa ratura, raturo thzange thza shemwa, inene ka ni raturire nofoci, unone ame na Tata oyu naa ni tumu. <verse eid="JHN 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 8:17" />Ku na ñoriwa mu Murao wenu ci ombangi wanu aidi po wa shemwa. <verse eid="JHN 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 8:18" />Naa pa ombangi keyi yange, no Tata oyu naa ni tumu naye aa pa ombangi keyi yange.”<verse eid="JHN 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 8:19" />A mwipurire ci: “Kupi a di Tata woe?” Yesu wa tawire ci: “Ame ka mu ni dimuka, no Tata naye ka mu mu dimuka. Nga mu na ni dimuka, no Tata nga mu na mu dimuka.” <verse eid="JHN 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 8:20" />Yesu wa ambire aa maywi o ku rongithsa mu Tembere mu ndau omu kekarire kakoño ko nupu. Unone kwithsa oyu wa mu kwatire, inene thsikati thsenthzi ka thsa kumine.<verse eid="JHN 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tumba mu twethsa ku thza oku ni thza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 8:21" />Wa wa amberire karo ci: “Naa thza, kenge mwa ku ni fotafota, unone kenge mwa ku fera mu thsivi thsenu. Oku ni thza amwe tumba mu twethsa ku kumako.”<verse eid="JHN 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 8:22" />Majuda ngou a ambire ci: “Ene kenge a ku cipaa ngeyi a ambera ci: ‘Oku ni thza, amwe tumba mu twethsa ku kumako nji’?”<verse eid="JHN 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 8:23" />Wa wa amberire ci: “Amwe po mwaa tunda pano pashi, ame naa tunda ku wiru. Amwe po mwakwa muno mu kaye, ame kadi no mukwa muno mu kaye. <verse eid="JHN 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 8:24" />Ni na mi ambera ci kenge mwa ku fera mu thsivi thsenu, inene ngeci ka mwa ku tawa ci Yame, kenge mwa ku fera mu thsivi thsenu.”<verse eid="JHN 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 8:25" />A mwipurire ci: “Ci yowe odye?” Yesu wa wa amberire ci: “Ko ku matatekero ni na mi tongwera ci yame nodye. <verse eid="JHN 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 8:26" />Ni di nenu yoingi eyi ni na roera ku amba keyi yenu no ku mi ratura. Unone oyu naa ni tumu po wa shemwa, karo naa tongwera anu o mu kaye eyi na ni yuvu ku kwenthzi.” <verse eid="JHN 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 8:27" />Ka yuvithsithsire ci Yesu shime a wa tongwerire ya Tata wenthzi.<verse eid="JHN 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 8:28" />Yesu ngou a wa amberire ci: “Ou mwa ku mana ku kureka Mwana Munu mbeci mwa ku dimuke ci Yame, no ku ninga ci kwithsa eyi ni na kwamanga kokoro wange nothsinda, unone naa amba dyodi a ni rongithsire Tata. <verse eid="JHN 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 8:29" />Karo oyu naa ni tumu nange a di. Ka a ni thsiererire nofoci, inene thsikati thsothsihe naa tendanga yo ku mu roerithsa.” <verse eid="JHN 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 8:30" />Owangi awa a mu yuvire o ku amba eyi enu a tawire ku kwenthzi.<verse eid="JHN 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Oshemwa kenge wa ku mi rukurura</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 8:31" />Yesu wa amberire Majuda awa a tawire ku kwenthzi ci: “Mwerongwa yange shemwa ngeci amwepo mu hengeka erongithsa yange. <verse eid="JHN 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 8:32" />Karo kenge mwa ku dimuka oshemwa, karo oshemwa kenge wa ku mi rukurura.”<verse eid="JHN 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 8:33" />A mu tawire ci: “Twanahoka a Aburahama, twa diyerire kwikara apika ku munu. Ine eyi o ambera ci: ‘Kenge mwa kurukururiwa?’” <verse eid="JHN 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 8:34" />Yesu wa wa tawire ci: “Naa mi tongwera yoshemwa ci munu yomuhe o ku tenda thsivi po mupika thsivi. <verse eid="JHN 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 8:35" />Mupika ka a variwerire mu rupathsi diyere, unone Mwana aye aa variwera mu rupathsi diyere. <verse eid="JHN 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 8:36" />Mweyo, ngeci Mwana aa mi rukurura, kenge mwa ku rukuruka shemwa. <verse eid="JHN 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 8:37" />Ni na dimuka ci mwanahoka a Aburahama, uno honi mwaa fota ku nipaa, inene ka mu fotire ku tambura diywi dyange. <verse eid="JHN 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 8:38" />Ame naa mi ambera eyi na monine kwa Tata, unone amwe mwaa tenda eyi na mu yuvu kwa tata wenu.”<verse eid="JHN 8:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 8:39" />A mu tawire ci: “Mukwathsañuru wetu po Aburahama.” Yesu wa wa amberire ci: “Nga mwana Aburahama nga mwaa tenda eyi a tendire. <verse eid="JHN 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 8:40" />Uno honi amwe mwaa fota ku nipaa shaanga ci na ni mi tongwera oshemwa ou na ni yuvu kwa Nyambi. Eyi ka di yodiyo a tendire Aburahama. <verse eid="JHN 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 8:41" />Mwaa tenda eyi a tendire tata wenu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:41">A mu tawire ci: “Ka twerekiwerire mu ruthziho atwe, tu di no Tata wetu yofoci pohuma aye Nyambi.”<verse eid="JHN 8:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 8:42" />Yesu wa wa amberire ci: “Nyambi nga Tata wenu, nga mu na ni shimi, inene kodiyo na ni tundu karo yame ono pano. Ka na ni cikeyera nothsinda, unone yodiyo na a ni tumu. <verse eid="JHN 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 8:43" />Ine eyi mu kanena ku yuvithsithsa eyi ni amba? Mukaci ko ku ninga ci ka mu fotire ku cinyandithsa ku ni teerera. <verse eid="JHN 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 8:44" />Mwaa tunda kwa tata wenu shamaonga, karo eshima yenu po ku tenda eshima ya tata wenu. Nedi thsipaanu ku tunda ku matatekero, karo ka a fota oshemwa, inene ka a di noshemwa mu mwenthzi. Yoihe angera, a amba eyi a neirera, inene wa kwangera karo yo tata o kwangera. <verse eid="JHN 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 8:45" />Uno honi ame naa amba oshemwa ngeyi mu kanena ku tawa ku kwange. <verse eid="JHN 8:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 8:46" />Ene kwaa di ku kwenu oyu nga o amba ci ni na tende thsivi? Ngeci naa mi tongwera oshemwa, ine eyi mu kanena ku tawa ku kwange? <verse eid="JHN 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 8:47" />Munu yomuhe o ku tunda kwa Nyambi aa teerera maywi a Nyambi. Uno honi amwe kadi cingwa mwaa tunda kwa Nyambi ngeyi mu kanena ku ni teerera.”<verse eid="JHN 8:47" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu na Aburahama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 8:48" />Majuda a mu tawire ci: “Ene kadi ya shemwa eyi tu amba ci o Musamaria owe karo ci o di no mupepo oumango?”<verse eid="JHN 8:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 8:49" />Yesu wa tawire ci: “Ka ni di no mupepo oumango. Naa remeka Tata, uno honi amwe ka mu ni remekire. <verse eid="JHN 8:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 8:50" />Kadi cingwa naa fota direma kwanu, unone kwaa di oyu di ni fotera, karo yodiyo mukwakuratura. <verse eid="JHN 8:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 8:51" />Naa mi tongwera yoshemwa, yomuhe o ku hengenga diywi dyange mbera ka a fu.”<verse eid="JHN 8:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 8:52" />Majuda a mu amberire ci: “Tu na dimuka honi yoshemwa ci o di no mupepo oumango. Aburahama wa fa, nakwakukethza wahe a fa, uno honi owe wa amba ci o ku hengeka diywi dyoe mbera ka a fu. <verse eid="JHN 8:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 8:53" />Owe ne o mukuru kupita tata wetu Aburahama oyu wa fire nji? Nakwakukethza nawo a fire, owe ne waa anekera ci yowe odye?”<verse eid="JHN 8:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 8:54" />Yesu wa tawire ci: “Ngeci nga o ni cishangare nothsinda, kucishangara kwange nga ka ku kwathsa thsimweya. Oyu na ni shangara po Tata oyu mu ninga ci Nyambi wenu. <verse eid="JHN 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 8:55" />Uno honi amwe ka mu mu dimuka, ame ni na mu dimuka. Ou nga ni amba ci ka ni mu dimuka, apo kenge nga nikara o kwangera eci amwe. Uno honi ni na mu dimuka no ku hengeka diywi dyenthzi. <verse eid="JHN 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 8:56" />Tata wenu Aburahama wa nyanyukire ci nga na mono diyuwa dyo kukeya kwange. Wa di monine karo wa nyanyukire nene.”<verse eid="JHN 8:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 8:57" />Majuda ngou a mu amberire ci: “Ko di no myaka shaanga thzo makumi mutanu thzo kwerekiwa, ngepi honi nga o amba ci shime waa mona Aburahama?”<verse eid="JHN 8:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 8:58" />Yesu wa wa amberire ci: “Naa mi tongwera yoshemwa ci Aburahama o ku shime kwerekiwa ame o ku ni diko.” <verse eid="JHN 8:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 8:59" />Ngou a torire mawe ci a mu kuhe, unone Yesu wa cihorekire no ku puna mu Tembere.<verse eid="JHN 8:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JHN 9" />
  <para style="rem">TA, TC, CC, HS, TA, CT2, BM</para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa porithsa mukwerume oyu werekiwire o ku di kapuputwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 9:1" />Yesu o ku pita wa monine munu oyu wekarire o ku di kapuputwa ku tunda ku kwerekiwa kwenthzi. <verse eid="JHN 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 9:2" />Erongwa yenthzi ya mwipurire ci: “Murongithsi, thsivi thsadye ethsi thsa retire ci oyu munu erekiwe o ku di kapuputwa? Thsivi thsenthzi nji thsashemienthzi?”<verse eid="JHN 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 9:3" />Yesu wa i tawire ci: “Kadi cingwa mukaci ko thsivi thsenthzi nji thsashemienthzi, unone eyo shime ya dikarire ci ekwama ya Nyambi i monaharere pa penthzi. <verse eid="JHN 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 9:4" />Twaa roera ku tenda ekwama yoyu naa ni tumu o uno mutenya, inene othsiku waa keya, apo honi kwithsa munu o ku twethsa ku kwama ekwama. <verse eid="JHN 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 9:5" />Uno ni di muno mu kaye, yame no mwethzi o kaye.”<verse eid="JHN 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 9:6" />Ou a manine ku amba kengeyo, Yesu wa thsiperire mate pashi no ku ruva marowa no mate enthzi. Wa rambire aya marowa pa meho oya kapuputwa <verse eid="JHN 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 9:7" />no ku mu ambera ci: “O thze o ka cihupe muya mu kayoano ka Siloami” (Siloami po kuninga ci Okutumiwa). Oya munu ngou a thzire no ku ka cihupa, wa ka hukire o ku mona.<figure style="fig" alt="Jesus heals man born blind" file="dn00456b.tif" size="col" loc="Jhn 9:6-9" copy="Dunham" ref="9.1-7">Yesu aa porithsa mukwerume oyu werekiwire o ku di kapuputwa</figure><verse eid="JHN 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 9:8" />Andambo nowa a mu monangire o ku romba a cipurire ci: “Oyu ne kadi yodiyo oya na ekaranga o ku romba nji?” <verse eid="JHN 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 9:9" />Amweya ci: “Yodiyo,” awa ci: “Dyombo, kadi yodiyo, aa cipitura pohuma nenthzi!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:9">Unone aye thsinda wa kwatererire ku wa ambera ci: “Yame shemwa!”<verse eid="JHN 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 9:10" />A mwipurire ci: “Ngepi a na thsikuka aa meho oe?”<verse eid="JHN 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 9:11" />Wa wa tawire ci: “Oyu munu nethsiwa ci Yesu yo na ruvu marowa no ku a ni ramba pa meho, no ku ni ambera ci: ‘O thze ku kayoano ka Siloami o ka cihupe.’ Ngou ni na thzi no ku ka cihupa, karo amepo ni mona.”<verse eid="JHN 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 9:12" />A mwipurire ci: “Kupi a di?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:12">Aye wa tawire ci: “Njone.”<verse eid="JHN 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Afarithsi aepaura oyo kapuputwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 9:13" />A twarire kwAfarithsi oya munu wekarire kapuputwa. <verse eid="JHN 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 9:14" />Edyo diyuwa a ruvire marowa Yesu no ku thsikura meho oya munu po nedi dyo Savata. <verse eid="JHN 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 9:15" />Mweyo, Afarithsi nawo epurire oya munu edi a twethsire ku mona. Aye wa wa amberire ci: “Kuma a na ni ramba marowa pa meho, ou ni na ka cihupa amepo ni mona.”<verse eid="JHN 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 9:16" />Afarithsi amweya a ambire ci: “Oyu munu kadi cingwa kwa Nyambi a tunda, inene aa kwama dyo Savata.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:16">Unone amweya a ambire ci: “Munu o thsivi ne ngepi edi nga a kwama emonithso yo kenge?” Mweyo, kwekarire kucitepa mu kaciko.<verse eid="JHN 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 9:17" />Afarithsi ngou epurire karo oya kapuputwa ci: “Waa anekera ine keyi yoyu munu na reta ci o mone?” Aye wa wa tawire ci: “Naa mona ci oyu munu po mukwakukethza.”<verse eid="JHN 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 9:18" />Napo Majuda shime kanine. Ka tawire ci oyu munu shime ekarire o ku di kapuputwa shime apo mbeci a mone. Ngou ethsire ashemienthzi <verse eid="JHN 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 9:19" />no ku na wepura ci: “Ene oyu ne mwanenu nji? Ene shime erekiwire shemwa o ku di kapuputwa? Ngepi honi a na twethsa ku mona pano?”<verse eid="JHN 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 9:20" />Ashemienthzi a tawire ci: “Twaa dimuka ci oyu munu po mwanetu, karo twaa dimuka ci dya erekiwire o ku di kapuputwa. <verse eid="JHN 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 9:21" />Uno honi ka tu dimuka edi ku na keya ci a mone honi, karo ka tu dimuka oyu na mu monithsa ci edye. Mu u cipwere, mukuru o munu oyu kenge a ciambera thsinda!” <verse eid="JHN 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 9:22" />Ashemienthzi shime ambire kengeyo mukaci ko ku yapa Majuda, inene Majuda shime a ciyuvire ci yomuhe oyu wa ku amba ci Yesu yodiyo Mesiya kenge a ku cithziwa mu sinagoge. <verse eid="JHN 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 9:23" />Eyo ngeyi a amberire ashemienthzi ci: “Mukuru o munu mu u cipwere.”<verse eid="JHN 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 9:24" />Afarithsi ethsire ro muthsidi oya munu wekarire kapuputwa no ku na mu ambera ci: “O shangare Nyambi!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Diambo dyo ku amba ci: “O ambe oshemwa pa meho a Nyambi.”</char></note> Atwe po tu na dimuka ci oyu munu po munu o thsivi.” <verse eid="JHN 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 9:25" />Aye wa tawire ci: “Nji munu o thsivi nji kadi munu o thsivi, eyo ame ka ni i dimuka. Eyi ni na dimuka pohuma po ci shime naekara kapuputwa, pano honi naa mona.”<verse eid="JHN 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 9:26" />A mwipurire ci: “Ine a na ku tende? Ngepi a na thsikura meho oe?” <verse eid="JHN 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 9:27" />Wa tawire ci: “Ni na mi tongwera kare ka mu fotire ku i teerera. Ine karo eyi mu fotera ku i yuva? Ene namwe mwaa fota kwikara erongwa yenthzi nji?”<verse eid="JHN 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 9:28" />A mu yukukerire no ku mu ambera ci: “Yowe o thsirongwa thsenthzi, atwe po twerongwa ya Mushe. <verse eid="JHN 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 9:29" />Atwe tu na dimuka ci Nyambi shime a ambire kwa Mushe. Uno honi eciko oyu munu oyu po ka tu dimuka noku a tunda ci kupi!”<verse eid="JHN 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 9:30" />Aye wa tawire ci: “Po i na komokithsera apo, ka mu dimuka noku a tunda, uno honi shaanga ikare kengeyo o na thsikura meho ange. <verse eid="JHN 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 9:31" />Atwe po twaa dimuka ci Nyambi ka a teererangire anu wevi, unone wa ku teerera o ku mu rombera no ku kwama eshima yenthzi. <verse eid="JHN 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 9:32" />Ku tunda ku matatekero o kaye twa diyerire tu yuvu munu oyu wa thsikura meho o munu oyu werekiwire o ku di kapuputwa. <verse eid="JHN 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 9:33" />Nga ka naa tundu kwa Nyambi oyu munu, nga ka a twethsire ku kwama thsimweya.”<verse eid="JHN 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 9:34" />Afarithsi a mu huthsire ci: “Owe po shime werekiwire o ku di munu o thsivi shemwa, waa anekera ci kenge nga o tu rongithsa owe nji?” Ngou a mu cithzerire pora.<verse eid="JHN 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kwikara kapuputwa kweyi yo mupepo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 9:35" />Yesu wa yuvire ci oya munu Majuda a na mu cithzi mu sinagoge. Yesu ou a mu wanine, wa mwipurire ci: “Ene waa tawa kwa Mwana Munu?”<verse eid="JHN 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 9:36" />Aye wa tawire ci: “Ñathsire wange, ngo u ni tongwere ci edye ni tawe ku kwenthzi!”<verse eid="JHN 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 9:37" />Yesu wa mu amberire ci: “O na mu mono, karo yodiyo oyu amba noe.”<verse eid="JHN 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 9:38" />Oya munu ngou a ambire ci: “Fumu, naa tawa,” no ku tongama ku rombera.<verse eid="JHN 9:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 9:39" />Yesu wa mu amberire ci: “Kuma na ni keya mu kaye ku reta raturo, ci tupuputwa tu mone, karo awa a mona a piruke tupuputwa.”<verse eid="JHN 9:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 9:40" />Afarithsi amweya awa ekarire po pepi a mu yuvire o ku amba kengeyo, a mwipurire ci: “Ene natwe twa tupuputwa nji?” <verse eid="JHN 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 9:41" />Yesu wa wa amberire ci: “Nga mwa tupuputwa nga ka mu di no murandu o thsivi. Uno honi pa ku amba ci mwaa mona, shimbi mwekarera anu o thsivi.”<verse eid="JHN 9:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JHN 10" />
  <para style="rem">TA, TC, CC, TA, BM</para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu yo mudithsani o muwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 10:1" />Yesu wa ambire ci: “Naa mi tongwera yoshemwa ci yomuhe o kukana kwingenena ku thsero thzo muraka o mangu, unone a engenena pa nyonga ko ku thzinamo, oyopo mwithzi karo dipuku. <verse eid="JHN 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 10:2" />Uno honi o kwingenena ku thsero yodiyo mudithsani o mangu. <verse eid="JHN 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 10:3" />Mukwakunyunga ku thsero aa mu yanthzurwera, karo no mangu aa yuva diywi dyenthzi. Aethsa mangu enthzi pa mathzina, karo a a tangerera ku tunda mu muraka. <verse eid="JHN 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 10:4" />O ku na punithsa mangu enthzi oahe, a a tangerera, no mangu aa mu shupwera, inene a na dimuka diywi dyenthzi. <verse eid="JHN 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 10:5" />Tumba a shupwera munu wao, unone aa mu yapa no ku mu cira, inene ka a dimuka diywi dyenthzi.”<figure style="fig" alt="Sheep fold and shepherds" file="lb00014b.tif" size="col" loc="Jhn 10:1-5" copy="Knowles" ref="10.1-5">Muraka o mangu nadithsani</figure><verse eid="JHN 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 10:6" />Yesu shime a wa tongwerire aka kathsimo, unone awo ka yuvithsithsire eyi a wa amberire. <verse eid="JHN 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 10:7" />Yesu ngou a wa amberire karo ci: “Naa mi tongwera yoshemwa ci yame no thsero thzo mangu. <verse eid="JHN 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 10:8" />Wahe awa keyire ame o ku ni shime ku keya ethzi no mapuku, unone mangu ka a wa teererire. <verse eid="JHN 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 10:9" />Yame no thsero. Yomuhe o kwingenena ku kwange kenge a ku yoyithsiwa, karo kenge a kwingena no ku puna pora no ku ka wana madyero. <verse eid="JHN 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 10:10" />Mwithzi aa keyeranga pohuma ku nethza, kwipaa no ku thzirithsa. Ame naa keyera ci ekare no mwoyo, karo a u wane kongi.<verse eid="JHN 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 10:11" />“Yame no mudithsani o muwa. Mudithsani o muwa aa shuvera mwoyo wenthzi mangu enthzi. <verse eid="JHN 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 10:12" />Munu o ku kumuna kadi cingwa mudithsani karo mangu kadi enthzi. Yoihe a mona mbinthzi o ku keya, aa thsia mangu no ku cira. Mweyo, mbinthzi aa na humbura mangu no ku a panthzaanithsa. <verse eid="JHN 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 10:13" />Aa cira, inene wa ku kumuna karo tumba a pakera maano mangu.<verse eid="JHN 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 10:14" />“Yame no mudithsani o muwa. Ni na dimuka mangu ange shemwa karo nao a na ni dimuka, <verse eid="JHN 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 10:15" />eci dyodi a na ni dimuka Tata karo name ni na mu dimuka. Mweyo, naa shuvera mwoyo wange mangu ange. <verse eid="JHN 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 10:16" />Ni di no mangu amweya, aa ninga ci kadi omu mu muraka. Nao naa roera ku a retamo. Kenge a ku teerera diywi dyange, karo kenge kwa kwikara mutanga ofoci no mudithsani yofoci.<verse eid="JHN 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 10:17" />“Tata aa ni shima, inene naa shuva mwoyo wange ci na ku u wane karo. <verse eid="JHN 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 10:18" />Kwithsa o ku twethsa ku ni nyanga mwoyo wange, naa u shuva keshima yange. Ni di nokoro o ku u shuva karo ni di nokoro o ku u huthsa karo. Inene eyi po yodiyo naa ni raerera Tata.”<verse eid="JHN 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 10:19" />Yesu ou a ambire eyi kwekarire karo kucitepa mu kaci ko Majuda. <verse eid="JHN 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 10:20" />Ongi wo a ambire ci: “O di no mupepo oumango karo aa thzaruka. Ine yo ku mu teererera?” <verse eid="JHN 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 10:21" />Amweya a ambire ci: “Aa po kadi maywi o munu oyu di no mupepo oumango. Ene mupepo oumango ne kenge nga u thsikura meho o kapuputwa?”<verse eid="JHN 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa amba ci yodiyo Mwana Nyambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 10:22" />Kethsiya thsikati Thsidika thso Kuyareka thsa tendaharire mu Yerusalema. Nedi pa kufu, <verse eid="JHN 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 10:23" />Yesu wa endaurire mu Tembere mu ndau ethzi thzi nethsiwa ci Makeke a Solomoni. <verse eid="JHN 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 10:24" />Majuda ngou a mu thzingwerire no ku mwipura ci: “Thsikati thso ku kuma kupi wa ku twikarithsa o ku tu tamangera? O tu tongwere shemwa ngeci yowe o Mesiya!”<verse eid="JHN 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 10:25" />Yesu wa wa tawire ci: “Na ni mi tongwera kare, unone kadi mwakwakutawa ku kwange. Ekwama eyi ni kwama mu dithzina dya Tata yaa pa ombangi keyi yange, <verse eid="JHN 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 10:26" />uno honi kadi mwakwa ku tawa pakuninga ci ka mu di pa mangu ange. <verse eid="JHN 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 10:27" />Mangu ange aa yuva diywi dyange, ni na a dimuka karo aa ni shupwera. <verse eid="JHN 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 10:28" />Na aa pa mwoyo o diyere, mbera ka a fu. Karo kwithsa oyu nga a ni nyanga mu dyoko dyange, <verse eid="JHN 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 10:29" />inene Tata naa a ni pa, karo aye mukuru kupita yoihe. Kwithsa o ku twethsa ku a nyanga mu dyoko dya Tata. <verse eid="JHN 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 10:30" />Ame na Tata po thsofoci.”<verse eid="JHN 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 10:31" />Napo karo Majuda a shimbire mawe ci a mu povaure. <verse eid="JHN 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 10:32" />Yesu ngou a wa tawire ci: “Na ni mi monithsa ekwama yoingi yoiwa yo ku tunda kwa Tata. Ipipo eyi mu fota ku ni povawera?”<verse eid="JHN 10:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 10:33" />Majuda a mu tawire ci: “Ka tu ku povawerire ekwama yoiwa, unone pa ku yengwa! Inene owe po o munu pohuma, unone waa ninga ci o Nyambi.”<verse eid="JHN 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 10:34" />Yesu wa tawire ci: “Ku na ñoriwa mu Murao wenu ci Nyambi wa ambire ci: ‘Naa amba ci mwanyambi!’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 82:6">Mem 82.6</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="JHN 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 10:35" />Ngeci wethsire anu awa piwire diywi dya Nyambi ci ‘anyambi,’ karo mu na dimuka ci Mañoro tumba a piruriwa, <verse eid="JHN 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 10:36" />aye honi ne, oyu a hangurire Tata no ku mu tuma mu kaye? Ine eyi mu ni shangethzera ci naa yengwa pa ku amba ci: ‘No Mwana Nyambi’? <verse eid="JHN 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 10:37" />Mwa ni tawa ngeci ka ni kwamine ekwama ya Tata. <verse eid="JHN 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 10:38" />Uno honi ngeci naa kwama ekwama ya Tata, shaanga ci kadi mwakwa ku tawa ku kwange, mu tawe eyo ekwama, ci nga mu dimuke no ku yuvithsithsa ci Tata mu mwange a di karo name mwa Tata ni di.”<verse eid="JHN 10:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 10:39" />Napo karo a fotire kwanga Yesu, unone wa wa thsevukire no ku cithzera. <verse eid="JHN 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 10:40" />Ngou a yavukire karo Rware rwa Jorodani ku thza muya mu ndau a korovethzerire anu Johani pa kutanga. Wa kekariremo, <verse eid="JHN 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 10:41" />karo anu owangi a keyire ku kwenthzi. A ambire ci: “Johani ka a kwamine emonithso, unone yoihe eyi a ambire keyi yoyu mukwerume ya shemwa.” <verse eid="JHN 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 10:42" />Karo ongi owa ekarire omo mu ndau a tawire kwa Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JHN 11" />
  <para style="rem">TA, TC, CC, TA, BM</para>
  <para style="s1">Kufa kwa Lazaro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 11:1" />Mukwerume o dithzina dyo Lazaro shime a korire. Shime a tungire mu Betania nandumbuthzenthzi a Madiya na Mareta. <verse eid="JHN 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 11:2" />Oyu yodiyo oya Madiya wa wethsire thsende edyato ya Fumu no ku i porora no huki thzenthzi. Lazaro oyu wa korire po nedi ndumbuthzenthzi. <verse eid="JHN 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 11:3" />Andumbuthzenthzi ngou a tumithsireko diywi ku ka mu tongwera ci: “Fumu, mbushoe oyu wa shima aa kora.” <verse eid="JHN 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 11:4" />Unone Yesu ou a i yuvire wa ambire ci: “Eyi ekora ka i twarire ku kufa. Uno honi yaa tendahara ci i monithse kutethzima kwa Nyambi, ci Mwana Nyambi nga a piwe kutethzima.”<verse eid="JHN 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 11:5" />Shaanga ci Yesu wa shimine Mareta na Madiya na Lazaro, <verse eid="JHN 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 11:6" />munyima thzo ku yuva ci Lazaro aa kora, wekarire mayuwa edi oku ekarire. <verse eid="JHN 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 11:7" />Munyima thzeyo, wa amberire erongwa yenthzi ci: “Tu hukenu ku Judea.”<verse eid="JHN 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 11:8" />Unone erongwa yenthzi ya mu tawire ci: “Murongithsi, ñanyiñanyi kuya na foto ku ku povaura no mawe Majuda, karo waa hukako?”<verse eid="JHN 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 11:9" />Yesu wa tawire ci: “Diyuwa dyofoci mutenya di di netunde dikumi naidi, nji kadi kengeyo? Ngeci munu aa enda mutenya, tumba a kuñuka, inene aa mona mukaci ko mwethzi o kano kaye. <verse eid="JHN 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 11:10" />Unone ngeci munu aa enda othsiku, aa kuñuka, inene kwithsa mwethzi mu mwenthzi.” <verse eid="JHN 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 11:11" />Ou a manine ku amba eyo wa i amberire ci: “Mbushetu Lazaro na rara, uno honi, naa thza ni ka mu pindure.”<verse eid="JHN 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 11:12" />Erongwa ya ambire ci: “Fumu, ngeci na rara kenge ekara nawa.” <verse eid="JHN 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 11:13" />Yesu shime a ambire yo kufa kwa Lazaro, unone ayo shime ya anekerire ci shime a ambire yo turo shemwa.<verse eid="JHN 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 11:14" />Yesu ngou a i tuywerire ci: “Lazaro na fu. <verse eid="JHN 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 11:15" />Uno honi mukaci kenu ni na roera pa ku kana kwikarako, inene pano honi kenge mu ka tawa shemwa. Tu thzenu tu ka mu mone.”<verse eid="JHN 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 11:16" />Tomasi oyu wethsiwire ci o Marambi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mu Thsigerike po “Didimasi” ku amba ci “Marambi.”</char></note> ngou a amberire aenthzenthzi erongwa ci: “Tu thzenu natwe tu ka fe nenthzi.”<verse eid="JHN 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu yodiyo kupinduka no mwoyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 11:17" />Yesu ou a ka kumineko wa ka wanine Lazaro o ku na mana mayuwa ane mu thsidi. <verse eid="JHN 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 11:18" />Ku tunda mu Yerusalema ku thza mu Betania nedi muendo o ku twethsa ku kwana tunano tuhatu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mu Thsigerike: Masitadia o dikumi na mutanu (tunano tuhatu).</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 11:19" />Majuda owangi a keyire kwa Mareta na Madiya ku kufa kwa ndumbuthzo ku na wa hengawethza. <verse eid="JHN 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 11:20" />Mareta ou a yuvire ci Yesu aa keya, wa mu shambawerire, unone Madiya aye wa thsiarire mu nthzio. <verse eid="JHN 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 11:21" />Mareta wa amberire Yesu ci: “Fumu, nga ko nokara, ndumbuthzange nga ka naa fu. <verse eid="JHN 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 11:22" />Uno honi shaanga pano ni na dimuka ci Nyambi kenge a ku pa yoihe eyi o romba.”<verse eid="JHN 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 11:23" />Yesu wa mu amberire ci: “Ndumbuthzoe kenge a pinduka.” <verse eid="JHN 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 11:24" />Mareta wa mu tawire ci: “Ii, ni na dimuka ci kenge a ku pinduka mu kupinduka kwafu mu diyuwa dyo mahurerero.”<verse eid="JHN 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 11:25" />Yesu wa mu amberire ci: “Yame no kupinduka no mwoyo. Yomuhe o ku tawa ku kwange kenge a ku yoya shaanga yoyu fa. <verse eid="JHN 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 11:26" />Munu yomuhe oyu yoya no ku tawa ku kwange mbera ka a fu. Ene waa tawa eyi Mareta?”<verse eid="JHN 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 11:27" />Wa mu tawire ci: “Ii, Fumu, naa tawa ci yowe o Mesiya Mwana Nyambi, oyu na roera ku keya mu kaye.”<verse eid="JHN 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa dira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 11:28" />Mareta ou a manine ku amba eyi, wa hukire no ku kethsera minenthzi Madiya ku mukunda. Wa mu ambera ci: “Murongithsi na kumu aa fota ku ku mona.” <verse eid="JHN 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 11:29" />Ou a i yuvire eyo, wa katukire wanguwangu no ku thza kwa Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 11:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 11:30" />Yesu apo o ku shime kwingena mu diumbo, o ku shimbi ekarera apa a ciwanenine na Mareta. <verse eid="JHN 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 11:31" />Majuda awa ekarire na Madiya mu nthzio o kwa mu hengawethza ou a mu monine o ku katuka wanguwangu no ku puna pora, a mu shupwerire pa ku anekera ci ngwa aa thza ku thsidi ku ka dira.<verse eid="JHN 11:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 11:32" />Madiya ou a ka kumine kwa Yesu no ku mu mona, wa tongamine ku manwi ku mauru a Yesu no ku amba ci: “Fumu, nga ko nokara, ndumbuthzange nga ka naa fu.”<verse eid="JHN 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 11:33" />Yesu ou a mu monine o ku dira, no Majuda awa mu thsindekethzire nawo o kwa dira, wa yuvire nene ku kora ku mucima no kwikara mu mathsiwa oakuru. <verse eid="JHN 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 11:34" />Wepurire ci: “Kupi oku na mu mu paka?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 11:34">A mu amberire ci: “Fumu, keye no mone.” <verse eid="JHN 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 11:35" />Yesu wa dirire. <verse eid="JHN 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 11:36" />Majuda a ambire ci: “Mu mone edi naa mu shimi!” <verse eid="JHN 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 11:37" />Unone amweya a ambire ci: “Oyu naa thsikura meho o kapuputwa, ene nga ka naa mu kwathsa ci a fa?”<verse eid="JHN 11:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa pindura Lazaro kwafu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 11:38" />Ko mathsiwa oakuru karo, Yesu wa keyire ku thsidi. Ethso thsidi po nedi dihorongo, ku mengeneno adyo shime kwa arumweniwire diwe. <verse eid="JHN 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 11:39" />Yesu wa ambire ci: “Mu arumuneko diwe.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 11:39">Unone Mareta ndumbuthza mufu wa mu amberire ci: “Fumu, ku na piti mayuwa ane ku tunda apa naa fera. Kenge ku tunda muwe oumango.”<verse eid="JHN 11:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 11:40" />Yesu wa mu tawire ci: “Ene ka ni ku amberire ci ngeci o tawe kenge o mona kutethzima kwa Nyambi?” <verse eid="JHN 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 11:41" />Ngou a arumunineko diwe. Yesu wa kengererire ku wiru no ku amba ci: “Tata naa kanderera ku koe pakuninga ci o na ni yuvu. <verse eid="JHN 11:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 11:42" />Ni na dimuka ci waa ni yuvanga thsikati thsothsihe, uno honi eyi ni na ambera kengeyo po ci wahe awa nemana pano nga a tawe ci yowe no ni tumu.” <verse eid="JHN 11:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 11:43" />Yesu ou a manine ku amba eyi, wa kumbire ko diywi dyodikuru ci: “Lazaro, o pune omo!” <verse eid="JHN 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 11:44" />Mufu wa puninemo moko enthzi no mauru enthzi o ku i na thzingiwa mwito, mutwi ao ku u na thzingiwa mu thsito thsathso. Yesu wa wa amberire ci: “Mu mu thzingunune, wangu mu mu thsie a thze!”<verse eid="JHN 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kayongo ko kwipaa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Mat 26.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Mar 14.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luk 22.1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 11:45" />Mweyo, ongi o Majuda awa keyire kwa Madiya no ku mona eyi a kwamine Yesu a tawire ku kwenthzi. <verse eid="JHN 11:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 11:46" />Uno honi amweya kukwo a thzire kwAfarithsi no ku ka wa tongwera eyi a kwamine Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 11:47" />Akuru o mapurisita nAfarithsi ngou a wanekire Nthzango no ku cipura ci: “Ngepi tu tenda? Inene oyu munu aa kwama emonithso yoingi. <verse eid="JHN 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 11:48" />Ngeci o tu mu thsierere ci a citwaratware, anu wahe kenge a ku tawa ku kwenthzi. Apo honi Maroma kenge a ku keya ku na umburura ndau thzetu no ditunga dyetu.”<verse eid="JHN 11:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 11:49" />Unone yumweya kukwo, Kayafa, oyu wekarire mupurisita shokuru oo mwaka, wa wa amberire ci: “Kwithsa nethsi mu na dimuka! <verse eid="JHN 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 11:50" />Ene ka mu monine ci ku di nawa ku kwenu ci munu yofoci a fere anu kupita ci ditunga dyodihe di fe.”<verse eid="JHN 11:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 11:51" />Eyo ka a i ciamberire yothsinda, unone pa kwikara mupurisita shokuru uya mwaka, shime okethzire ci Yesu kenge a ku fera ditunga dyodihe. <verse eid="JHN 11:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 11:52" />Karo kadi cingwa ditunga pohuma, unone no ku reta pofoci ana Nyambi awa a na ciyamba kaye kokahe.<verse eid="JHN 11:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 11:53" />Ku tatekera edyo diyuwa aendithsi o Majuda a tatekire ku ceka dyo kwipaa Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 11:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 11:54" />Mukaci keyo, Yesu wa thsiire ku enda ko ku cimonaharithsa mu kaci ko Majuda. Wa tundire omo mu ndau no ku thza mu ndau thzathzo pepi no dikunguthsitu mu mbongi ethzi thzi nethsiwa Eferaimi oku a kekarire nerongwa yenthzi.<verse eid="JHN 11:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 11:55" />Thsidika thso Majuda thso Paseka thsekarire po pepi. Anu owangi mu mandau oahe a kambamine ku thza ku Yerusalema thsidika o ku thsi shime ku tateka ci nga a twethse ku ka cikenithsa. <verse eid="JHN 11:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 11:56" />A fotafotire Yesu no ku ciambithsana o kwa nemana mu ndau thzo mu Tembere ci: “Mwaa mona ngepi? Ci ka a ku keya ku Paseka nji?” <verse eid="JHN 11:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 11:57" />Akuru o mapurisita nAfarithsi shime a raererire ci ngeci kwaa di oyu na dimuka oku a di Yesu, a ka mu tongore ci nga a mwange.<verse eid="JHN 11:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JHN 12" />
  <para style="rem">TA, TC, CC, TA, BM</para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa wethsiwa thsende mu Betania</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Mat 26.6-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Mar 14.3-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 12:1" />Shime kwa thsiarire pohuma mayuwa o mutanu na dyofoci ci thsidika thso Paseka thsi tateke. Yesu wa thzire ku Betania, omu a tungire Lazaro oya a pindurire kwafu. <verse eid="JHN 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 12:2" />Oko Yesu a ka mu kwamenineko edya. Mareta yo wa taperire edya, Lazaro aye nedi yumweya owa ekarire ku tafure na Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 12:3" />Madiya ngou a shimbire kakeka ko thsende o ku nuka nawa no ku tura nene, wa mu wethsire pedyato ya Yesu no ku i porora ko huki thzenthzi. Nthzio thzothzihe thza yarire muwe oyo thsende.<figure style="fig" alt="Mary anoints Jesus' feet" file="cn01778c.tif" size="col" loc="Jhn 12:1-3" copy="Cook" ref="12.1-3">Madiya aa wethsa edyato ya Yesu</figure><verse eid="JHN 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 12:4" />Unone thsimweya kwirongwa yenthzi thso dithzina dyo Judasi Isikariota, ethsi thsa mu ombire, thsa ambire ci: <verse eid="JHN 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 12:5" />“Ine eyi a na kana ku urithsiwera oyu thsende no ku shimba ao madi ku pa ahepwe? Aa twethsa ku uriwa madi o ku hora mu mwaka?” <verse eid="JHN 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 12:6" />Ka a ambire kengeyo mukaci ko ku fera ñeke ahepwe, unone mukaci ko ku ninga ci nedi mwithzi. Karo ko kwikara mukwakunyunga thsipaupau thso madi, shime aethzangamo.<verse eid="JHN 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 12:7" />Yesu wa ambire ci: “Mu mu thsie a turekere ethsi a di nathso diyuwa dyo ku vumbekiwa kwange. <verse eid="JHN 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 12:8" />Ahepwe kenge mwikarangano thsikati thsothsihe, uno honi ame ka mwa kwikarerera nange.”<verse eid="JHN 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kayongo ko kwipaa Lazaro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 12:9" />Mbunga thzothzikuru thzo Majuda ou a yuvire ci Yesu na kumu mu Betania, a thzireko. Ka thzire kwa Yesu pohuma, unone no ku ka mona Lazaro oya a pindurire Yesu kwafu. <verse eid="JHN 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 12:10" />Mweyo, akuru o mapurisita a cekire kwipaa no Lazaro kengeyo, <verse eid="JHN 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 12:11" />pakuninga ci yodiyo wa retithsire ci Majuda owangi a wa thsie no ku tawa kwa Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aengena mu Yerusalema</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Mat 21.1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Mar 11.1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luk 19.28-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 12:12" />Diyuwa edi dya randireko, mbunga thzothzikuru ethzi thza keyire ku thsidika thso Paseka thza yuvire ci Yesu aa keya ku Yerusalema. <verse eid="JHN 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 12:13" />Ngou a shimbire mite thzo makaka no ku mu shambawera o kwa ka thza o kumba ci: “Hosana!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ku shangariwe Nyambi.</char></note> Wa thsiyauthzi oyu keya mu dithzina dya Fumu! Wa thsiyauthzi Fumu o Maisiraele.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:25">Mem 118.25</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 118:26">26</ref>.</char></note>” <verse eid="JHN 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 12:14" />Yesu wa wanine thsindongiana no ku pahamapo, eci dyodi ku na ñoriwa ci: <verse eid="JHN 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 12:15" />“Mwa yapa amwe mwanu o mu Sione. Nga mu mone, Fumu wenu oyo keya o ku na pahama pa thsindongiana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 9:9">Zak 9.9</ref>.</char></note>”<verse eid="JHN 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 12:16" />Mwethso thsikati erongwa ya Yesu ka ya yuvithsithsire eyo pa kutanga, unone Yesu ou engenine mu kutethzima, a vurukire ci eyo enu ya ñoriwire keyi yenthzi, karo na i tendiwa ku kwenthzi.<verse eid="JHN 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 12:17" />Anu owangi awa a monine Yesu o kwithsa Lazaro ci a tunde mu thsidi, ku mu pindura kwafu, a twarire ku rupara ku pa ombangi wayo. <verse eid="JHN 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 12:18" />Eyo ngeyi ya retire ci anu owangi a mu shambawere, inene shime a yuvire ethsi thsimonithso. <verse eid="JHN 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 12:19" />Afarithsi ngou a i ciyongorire ci: “Mu na mono, kwithsa neyi tu kwama! Kaye kokahe kaa mu shupwera.”<verse eid="JHN 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu a okethza yo kufa kwenthzi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 12:20" />Amweya kowa a thzire ku Yerusalema ku ka rombera pa thsidika nedi Magerike. <verse eid="JHN 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 12:21" />A thzire kwa Filipu o mu Betisaida mu Galilea no ku ka romba ci: “Ñathsire wetu, twaa fota ku mona Yesu.” <verse eid="JHN 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 12:22" />Filipu wa thzire ku ka tongwera Andereasi. Ngou a thzire momu widi wo kwa Yesu ku ka mu tongwera.<verse eid="JHN 12:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 12:23" />Yesu wa tawire ci: “Thsikati thsa Mwana Munu thsi na kumu thso kwingena mu kutethzima kwenthzi. <verse eid="JHN 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 12:24" />Naa mi tongwera yoshemwa ci shime ci dinona dyo vuroto di were pashi no ku fa, kenge dya kwikarerera kengeyo dyofoci. Uno honi ngeci dyaa fa, dyaa reta oheke oungi. <verse eid="JHN 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 12:25" />Munu yomuhe o ku shima mwoyo wenthzi muno mu kaye kenge a ku u yawa. Unone yomuhe o ku thzimba mwoyo wenthzi muno mu kaye kenge a ku u turekera mwoyo o diyere. <verse eid="JHN 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 12:26" />Munu yomuhe o ku ni kwamena, aa roera ku ni shupwera, karo oku ni di, no ngamba wange kodiyo a kwikara. Munu yomuhe o ku ni kwamena, Tata kenge a ku mu pa direma.<verse eid="JHN 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 12:27" />“Pano ni di mucima wange waa cithzekera. Ni ambe ngepi? Ene ni ambe ci: ‘Tata, o ni amwene ko thsino thsikati’? Uno honi thsino thsikati thsodiyo na ni keyera. <verse eid="JHN 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 12:28" />Tata, o yemekere dithzina dyoe!” Ngou kwa yuvaharire diywi ku wiru edi dya ambire ci: “Na ni di remeka, karo kenge na ku di remeka karo.” <verse eid="JHN 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 12:29" />Anu awa ekarirepo ou a yuvire diywi a ambire ci: “Mvura oya vuma!” Awa amweya a ningire ci: “Kangeru ka na amba nenthzi!”<verse eid="JHN 12:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 12:30" />Unone Yesu wa wa amberire ci: “Diya diywi mu yuva ka di keyerire mukaci kange, unone mukaci kenu. <verse eid="JHN 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 12:31" />Thsino thsodiyo thsikati thso ku ratura kano kaye, pano honi muendithsi o kano kaye kenge a ku konthzeriwa pora. <verse eid="JHN 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 12:32" />Ou na ku kurekiwa pano pa pashi, mbeci na ku kokere anu wahe ku kwange.” <verse eid="JHN 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 12:33" />Shime a ambire eyi ku dimukithsa mufero ou a fire.<verse eid="JHN 12:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 12:34" />Mbunga thza ambire ci: “Twaa yuva mu Murao ci Mesiya kenge a ku yoya diyere. Owe ne ngepi edi o amba ci Mwana Munu aa roera ku kurekiwa? Edye honi oyu Mwana Munu?”<verse eid="JHN 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 12:35" />Yesu wa tawire ci: “Mwethzi kenge wikara nenu mu thsikati thsothsipu pohuma. Mu ende mu mwethzi pano u diko ci mirema katere thzi mi thsike. Munu o ku enda mu mirema ka a dimukire oku a thza. <verse eid="JHN 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 12:36" />Mu tawe ku mwethzi pano mu di nao ci nga mu piruke ana mwethzi.” Yesu ou a manine ku amba eyi, wa thzire no ku ka cihoreka.<verse eid="JHN 12:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kukana kutawa ko Majuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 12:37" />Shaanga ci Yesu wa tendire emonithso yoingi pa meho o, anu ka tawire ku kwenthzi. <verse eid="JHN 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 12:38" />Eyi ya tendaharire ci i citombore eyi a ambire mukwakukethza Isaya ci:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:38">“Fumu, edye oyu naa tawa muthzimbu wetu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:38">Karo kwadye oku na u hokweriwa okoro wa Fumu?”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:1">Isa 53.1</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="JHN 12:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 12:39" />Mweyo, ka twethsire ku tawa, inene Isaya wa ambire karo ci:<verse eid="JHN 12:39" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 12:40" />“Nyambi naa thzimanithsa meho o,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:40">no ku karupithsa micima thzo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:40">ci meho o a twethsa ku mona,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:40">no micima thzo ci thza twethsa ku yuvithsithsa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:40">ci katere a huke ku kwange no ku na wa porithsa.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:10">Isa 6.10</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="JHN 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 12:41" />Isaya wa ambire eyi, inene wa monine kutethzima kwa Yesu, ngou a ambire yenthzi. <verse eid="JHN 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 12:42" />Shaanga kengeyo, owangi kwaendithsi o Majuda a tawire ku kwenthzi. Uno honi mukaci ko ku yapa Afarithsi, Majuda ka pire ombangi ci a tawire kwa Yesu ci katere a cithziwe mu sinagoge, <verse eid="JHN 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 12:43" />inene shime a shimine ku shangariwa kwanu kupita ku shangariwa kwa Nyambi.<verse eid="JHN 12:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 12:44" />Yesu wa kumbire ku amba ci: “Yomuhe o ku tawa ku kwange ka a tawire ku kwange pohuma, unone aa tawa noku koyu naa ni tumu. <verse eid="JHN 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 12:45" />Karo yomuhe o ku ni mona, aa mona oyu naa ni tumu. <verse eid="JHN 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 12:46" />Ame shime na ni keya muno mu kaye eci mwethzi, ku na munekera munu yomuhe o ku tawa ku kwange ci ekarerera mu mirema. <verse eid="JHN 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 12:47" />Ngeci munu aa yuva maywi ange unone kadi wa ku a hengeka, tumba ni mu ratura. Inene ka na ni keyera ku na ratura kaye, unone naa keyera ku na ka yoyithsa. <verse eid="JHN 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 12:48" />Unone yomuhe o ku ni kana no ku kana maywi ange, o a maywi ni amba odiyo a ku mu ratura mu diyuwa dyo mahurerero. <verse eid="JHN 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 12:49" />Inene ka ni ambire kokoro wange, unone Tata oyu naa ni tumu yo na ni raerera ku amba eyi ni na roera ku tongora. <verse eid="JHN 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 12:50" />Karo ni na dimuka ci thsiraerera thsenthzi thsaa reta mwoyo o diyere. Mweyo, thsothsihe ethsi ni amba naa thsi amba kokuthza komu naa thsi ni tongwerera Tata.”<verse eid="JHN 12:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JHN 13" />
  <para style="rem">TA, TC, CC, TA, BM</para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa yoa edyato yerongwa yenthzi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 13:1" />Thsikati thso Paseka ou thsa kokerire po pepi, Yesu wa dimukire ci thsikati thsenthzi thsi na kumu thso ku thsia kano kaye no ku thza kwa Tata wenthzi. Thsikati thsothsihe wa shimine awo ekarire enthzi muno mu kaye, karo wa wa shimine ku twara ku mahurerero. <verse eid="JHN 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 13:2" />Yesu nerongwa o kwa dya murarero, shamaonga wa pire kare Judasi mwana Simoni Isikariota eanekera yo ku omba Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 13:3" />Yesu wa dimukire ci Tata wenthzi wa mu pire okoro wenu yoihe, karo ci shime a tundire kwa Nyambi, karo kenge a ku huka kwa Nyambi. <verse eid="JHN 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 13:4" />Yesu wa katukire ku tafure, wa cishupurire thsikoveyo thsenthzi thso peuru no ku cianga tauro mu mbunda. <verse eid="JHN 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 13:5" />Ngou a pakire meyu mu dironga no ku tateka ku yoa edyato yerongwa yenthzi no ku i porora no tauro ethzi a ciangire mu mbunda.<verse eid="JHN 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 13:6" />Wa kumine pa Simoni Peturu oyu wa mu amberire ci: “Fumu, ene waa fota ku yoa edyato yange nji?” <verse eid="JHN 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 13:7" />Yesu wa mu tawire ci: “Pano ko yuvithsithsa eyi ni tenda, unone ku rupara kenge wa ku i yuvithsithsa.”<verse eid="JHN 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 13:8" />Peturu wa mu amberire ci: “Dikuce ku yoa edyato yange.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 13:8">Yesu wa tawire ci: “Ngeci ka ni yoo edyato yoe, ko wa kwikara wange.”<verse eid="JHN 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 13:9" />Simoni Peturu wa mu amberire ci: “Fumu, wa yoa edyato yange pohuma, unone o yoe moko no mutwi wange kengeyo.” <verse eid="JHN 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 13:10" />Yesu wa mu amberire ci: “Munu oyu na cihupu ka a roerire ku cihupa karo, shime ku ciyoa kwidyato yenthzi pohuma, unone erama yenthzi yoihe ikenu. Amwe mwa kenu, uno honi kadi cingwa mwahe.” <verse eid="JHN 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 13:11" />Yesu wa dimukire ci edye oyu wa ku mu omba, ngeyi a amberire ci: “Kadi cingwa mwahe mwakenu.”<verse eid="JHN 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 13:12" />Ou a manine ku yoa edyato yerongwa yenthzi, wa vatire thsikoveyo thsenthzi no ku huka ku tafure. Wa i amberire ci: “Ene mu na yuvithsithsa eyi ni na tende ku kwenu? <verse eid="JHN 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 13:13" />Mwaa ni thsa ci Murongithsi no Fumu, karo yashemwa, inene yame. <verse eid="JHN 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 13:14" />Uno honi, ngeci ame no Fumu, karo Murongithsi wenu ni na yoo edyato yenu, namwe kengeyo mwaa roera ku ciyoa oandu edyato. <verse eid="JHN 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 13:15" />Ni na mi monithsa yo ku tenda, ci namwe mwaa roera ku tenda dyodi ni na tende ku kwenu. <verse eid="JHN 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 13:16" />Naa mi tongwera yoshemwa ci ngamba tumba a piti ñathsire wenthzi, karo oyu naa tumiwa tumba a piti oyu naa mu tumu. <verse eid="JHN 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 13:17" />Uno mu na dimuka eyi, mwakwa thsiyauthzi ngeci amwepo mu i tenda.<verse eid="JHN 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 13:18" />“Ka ni ningire amwe mwahe, ni na dimuka awa na ni hangura. Unone eyi i na ñoriwa mu Mañoro yaa roera ku citombora, yo ku ninga ci: ‘Oyu na di nange dikende dyange o na ni piruka.’ <verse eid="JHN 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 13:19" />Naa mi tongwera eyi o ku i shime ku tendahara, ci ou ya ku tendahara, nga mwa ku tawe ci Yame. <verse eid="JHN 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 13:20" />Naa mi tongwera yoshemwa, yomuhe o ku tambura oyu ni na tumu, name aa ni tambura kengeyo. Karo yomuhe o ku ni tambura aa tambura noyu naa ni tumu.”<verse eid="JHN 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 13:21" />Yesu ou a manine ku amba eyi wa cinyengire mu mupepo wenthzi, ngou a pire ombangi ci: “Naa mi tongwera yoshemwa ci yumweya ku kwenu kenge a ni omba.”<verse eid="JHN 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 13:22" />Erongwa ya cikengakengire, o ku i na cikomokera nene ko kukana ku dimuka ci oyu a ninga ne edye. <verse eid="JHN 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 13:23" />Thsimweya kwirongwa ya Yesu, ethsi a shimine nene, thsekarire ku nyonga thzenthzi. <verse eid="JHN 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 13:24" />Simoni Peturu wa thsi rapethzire no ku thsi ambera ci: “O mwipure ci edye oyu a ninga?” <verse eid="JHN 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 13:25" />Thsiya thsirongwa thsa hendamenine Yesu thsa mwipurire ci: “Fumu, ene edye oyu o ninga?”<verse eid="JHN 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 13:26" />Yesu wa tawire ci: “Aye oyu ni pa ethsi thsipara thso dikende ou ni mana ku thsierera yodiyo.” Ou a manine kwerera ethso thsipara thso dikende wa thsi pire Judasi mwana Simoni Isikariota. <verse eid="JHN 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 13:27" />Judasi ou a manine ku tambura edyo dikende, popo Satana wa mwingenine. Yesu wa mu amberire ci: “O i tende wanguwangu eyi o tamba ku tenda.” <verse eid="JHN 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 13:28" />Uno honi awa ekarire nenthzi ku tafure kwithsa oyu wa yuvithsithsire eyi a ambire Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 13:29" />Pakuninga ci Judasi nedi yodiyo mukwakunyunga thsipaupau thso madi, amweya kukwo a anekerire ci Yesu shime a mu amberire ci a ka ure eyi ya fotaharire pa thsidika, nji ci a ka pe thsimweya kwahepwe. <verse eid="JHN 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 13:30" />Mweyo, Judasi ou a manine ku tambura edyo dikende, popo wa punine pora. Apo nedi othsiku.<verse eid="JHN 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Thsiraerera thsothsipe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 13:31" />Judasi o ku na thzi pora, Yesu wa ambire ci: “Pano honi Mwana Munu aa piwa kutethzima, karo no Nyambi aa piwa kutethzima mu mwenthzi. <verse eid="JHN 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 13:32" />Ngeci Nyambi aa piwa kutethzima mu mwenthzi, Nyambi naye kenge a mu pa kutethzima mu mwenthzi aye, karo kenge a ku mu pa kutethzima popo mwene. <verse eid="JHN 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 13:33" />Anange, kenge nikara nenu thsikati thsothsipu pohuma. Kenge mwa ku ni fotafota, karo dyodiya na amberire Majuda, pano honi naa i mi ambera namwe ci oku ni thza tumba mu twethsa ku kumako. <verse eid="JHN 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 13:34" />Naa mi pa thsiraerera thsothsipe. Mu cishime, eci ame edi ni na mi shimi, namwe mu cishime kengeyo. <verse eid="JHN 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 13:35" />Yoihe mu cishima, anu wahe mbeci a dimuke ci mwerongwa yange.”<verse eid="JHN 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa ambera Peturu ci kenge a mu hamura</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Mat 26.31-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Mar 14.27-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luk 22.31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 13:36" />Simoni Peturu wa mwipurire ci: “Fumu, ene kupi oku o thza?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 13:36">Yesu wa tawire ci: “Tumba o twethsa ku ni shupwera thsino thsikati oku ni thza, uno honi ku rupara kenge wa ku ni shupwera.”<verse eid="JHN 13:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 13:37" />Peturu wa mwipurire ci: “Fumu, ine eyi nga ni kana ku twethsa ku ku shupwera thsino thsikati? Ni na ciroithsera ku ku fera!”<verse eid="JHN 13:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 13:38" />Yesu wa tawire ci: “Ene o na ciroithsera shemwa ku ni fera? Naa ku ambera yoshemwa ci ñombwe o ku shime kwiya kenge o ni hamura ruhatu!”<verse eid="JHN 13:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JHN 14" />
  <para style="rem">TA, TC, CC, TA</para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu, aye dikuñwa dyo ku thza kwa Tata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 14:1" />Yesu ngou a wa amberire ci: “Mwa cithzekera mu micima thzenu. Mu tawe kwa Nyambi no ku tawa noku ku kwange kengeyo. <verse eid="JHN 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 14:2" />Mu nthzio thza Tata mo tu di tupingwethzi totungi. Nga kadi kengeyo ne, ine nga ni na mi amberera ci naa thza ni ka mi roithsere ndau? <verse eid="JHN 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 14:3" />Ou na ku thza no ku ka mi roithsera ndau, kenge na ku ka huka ku na mi shimba ci mu kekare nange oku ni di. <verse eid="JHN 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 14:4" />Mu na dimuka dikuñwa edi di thza oku ni thza.”<verse eid="JHN 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 14:5" />Tomasi wa mu tawire ci: “Fumu, ka tu dimuka oku thza, ngepi honi nga tu dimuka dikuñwa dyo ku thzako?”<verse eid="JHN 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 14:6" />Yesu wa mu amberire ci: “Yame no dikuñwa, oshemwa no mwoyo. Kwithsa o ku keya kwa Tata shime ku pitera pa pange. <verse eid="JHN 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 14:7" />Ngeci mu na ni dimuka shemwa, kenge mwa ku dimuka no Tata. Ku tunda thsino thsikati mu na mu dimuka no ku mu mona.”<verse eid="JHN 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 14:8" />Filipu wa mu amberire ci: “Fumu, o tu monithse Tata, apo honi kenge tu rakwa.”<verse eid="JHN 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 14:9" />Yesu wa tawire ci: “Na nikara nenu thsikati thsothsire, epo no pano tu di o shime ku ni dimuka, Filipu? Yomuhe oyu naa ni mono, naa mono Tata. Ngepi edi nga o amba ci: ‘O tu monithse Tata’? <verse eid="JHN 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 14:10" />Ene ko tawire ci ame mwa Tata ni di no Tata mu mwange a di? Maywi aa ni mi ambera ka ni a ambire kokoro wange nothsinda, unone Tata oyu di mu mwange yodiyo oyu kwama ekwama yenthzi. <verse eid="JHN 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 14:11" />Mu tawe ci ame mwa Tata ni di no Tata mu mwange a di. Ngeci kadi kengeyo, mu tawe mukaci keyi ekwama mu mona o ku ni kwama.<verse eid="JHN 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 14:12" />“Naa mi tongwera yoshemwa ci yomuhe o ku tawa ku kwange naye kenge a ku kwama ekwama eyi ni kwama, mane kenge a ku kwama yoikuru kupita eyi, inene naa thza kwa Tata. <verse eid="JHN 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 14:13" />Karo kenge na ku tenda yoihe eyi mwa ku romba mu dithzina dyange, ci Tata a piwe kutethzima mwa Mwana. <verse eid="JHN 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 14:14" />Thsinu thsothsihe ethsi mwa ku romba mu dithzina dyange kenge na ku thsi tenda.<verse eid="JHN 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Thsikumbwethzo thso Mupepo Oukenu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 14:15" />“Ngeci mwakwa ku ni shima, kenge mwa ku hengeka eraerera yange. <verse eid="JHN 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 14:16" />Kenge na ku romba Tata ci a mi pe Mukwakukwathsa yumweya oyu mbo wikara nenu diyere, <verse eid="JHN 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 14:17" />aye Mupepo o shemwa. Anu o kaye tumba a twethsa ku mu tambura, inene ka mu monine nji ku mu dimuka. Uno honi amwe mu na mu dimuka pakuninga ci ku kwenu a di karo kenge a kwikarerera ku kwenu. <verse eid="JHN 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 14:18" />Ka na ku mi thsia eci athsiana, kenge na ku keya ku kwenu. <verse eid="JHN 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 14:19" />Ku na thsiara thsikati thsothsipu pohuma anu o kaye ka ku ni mona karo. Unone amwe kenge mwa ku ni mona. Pakuninga ci naa yoya, namwe kengeyo kenge mwa ku yoya. <verse eid="JHN 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 14:20" />Mwedyo diyuwa kenge mwa ku dimuka ci ame mwa Tata ni di, namwe mu mwange mu di, karo name mu mwenu ni di. <verse eid="JHN 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 14:21" />Yomuhe o ku tambura eraerera yange no ku i hengeka, yodiyo wa ni shima. Karo o ku ni shima, Tata kenge a ku mu shima, karo name kenge na ku mu shima, karo kenge na ku cihokora ku kwenthzi.”<verse eid="JHN 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 14:22" />Judasi (kadi Judasi Isikariota) wa mu amberire ci: “Fumu, ine eyi wa ku cihokwera ku kwetu pohuma kadi ku kaye kokahe?”<verse eid="JHN 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 14:23" />Yesu wa mu tawire ci: “O ku ni shima yomuhe kenge a ku hengeka diywi dyange. Tata kenge a ku mu shima, karo Tata name kenge twa ku keya ku kwenthzi no ku na yoya nenthzi. <verse eid="JHN 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 14:24" />O kukana ku ni shima ka a hengekire maywi ange. Aa maywi mu yuva ka a tundire ku kwange, unone aa tunda kwa Tata oyu naa ni tumu.<verse eid="JHN 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 14:25" />“Eyi enu ni na i mi tongwera uno ni di nenu. <verse eid="JHN 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 14:26" />Uno honi Mukwakukwathsa, aye Mupepo Oukenu, oyu a ku mi tumithsera Tata mu dithzina dyange, kenge a ku na mi rongithsa enu yoihe no ku na mi vurukithsa yoihe eyi na ni mi tongwera.<verse eid="JHN 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 14:27" />“Naa mi thsiera thsiyaro, naa mi pa thsiyaro thsange. Ka ni mi pire eci edi a na panga anu o kaye. Mwekara no thsorokoto ku micima nji ku yapa. <verse eid="JHN 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 14:28" />Na mu ni yuvu uya na ni mi ambera ci: ‘Naa thza, karo kenge na ku ka huka ku kwenu.’ Nga mwakwa ku ni shima yoshemwa, kenge nga mu nyanyuka ku yuva ci naa thza kwa Tata, inene aye po mukuru ku ni pita. <verse eid="JHN 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 14:29" />Na ni i mi tongwera o ku i shime ku tendahara, ci ou ya ku tendahara mwa ku tawe.<verse eid="JHN 14:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 14:30" />“Ka ni amba nenu thsikati thsothsire, inene muendithsi o kano kaye aa keya. Unone ka a di nokoro pa pange. <verse eid="JHN 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 14:31" />Uno honi naa roera ku tenda eyi naa ni raerera Tata, ci kaye ka dimuke ci no mukwa ku shima Tata. Mu katuke, tu thze, tu tunde pano.”<verse eid="JHN 14:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JHN 15" />
  <para style="rem">TA, TC, CC, TA</para>
  <para style="s1">Yame no thsitondo shemwa thso veine</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 15:1" />“Yame no thsitondo shemwa thso veine, karo Tata yodiyo njimi. <verse eid="JHN 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 15:2" />Mute ouhe ku kwange o kukana kwima aa u tetako, karo mute ouhe o kwima ima aa u poywera ci wime ima yoingi. <verse eid="JHN 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 15:3" />Na mu kenithsiwa kare ko maywi aa na ni mi ambera. <verse eid="JHN 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 15:4" />Mwikarerere mu mwange eci edi ni di mu mwenu. Dyodi u na kananga kwima mute o veine pa pao ofoci shime ci wikare ku thsitondo thsao, namwe tumba mu twethsa kwima shime ci mwikarerere mu mwange.<figure style="fig" alt="Vine and branches" file="hk00110b.tif" size="col" loc="Jhn 15:1-4" copy="Knowles" ref="15.1-4">Thsitondo thso veine no mite thzathso</figure><verse eid="JHN 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 15:5" />“Yame no thsitondo thso veine, amwe yamwe mwa mite. Yomuhe o kwikara mu mwange name mu mwenthzi, oyo yodiyo o kwima ima yoingi, inene ko kupira ame tumba mu twethsa ku tenda thsimweya. <verse eid="JHN 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 15:6" />O kukana kwikara mu mwange aa konthziwa eci mute no ku kukuta. Mite thzo kengeyo thza ongeriwa no ku konthzeriwa mu mudiro no ku pya. <verse eid="JHN 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 15:7" />Ngeci amwepo mwikarerera mu mwange no maywi ange aopo ekarerera mu mwenu, mu rombe yoihe eyi mu na foto, karo kenge mwa ku i tenderiwa. <verse eid="JHN 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 15:8" />Kutethzima kwa Tata kwaa monahara ngeci amwepo mwima ima yoingi, karo pa ku tenda kengeyo mwaa monithsa ci mwerongwa yange.<verse eid="JHN 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 15:9" />“Eci edi a ni shima Tata name naa mi shima kengeyo. Mwikarerere mu thsishimo thsange. <verse eid="JHN 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 15:10" />Ngeci amwepo mu hengeka eraerera yange, kenge mwa kwikarerera mu thsishimo thsange, eci dyodi na ni hengeka eraerera ya Tata no kwikarerera mu thsishimo thsenthzi.<verse eid="JHN 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 15:11" />“Ni na mi ambera eyi enu ci thsinyanyu thsange thsikare mu mwenu, karo ci thsinyanyu thsenu thsikare thso kukwana. <verse eid="JHN 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 15:12" />Thsiraerera thsange po ethsi: Mu cishime oandu eci edi na ni mi shimi. <verse eid="JHN 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 15:13" />Kwithsa thsishimo thsothsikuru kupita ethsi: munu ku pa mwoyo wenthzi mukaci kambushenthzi. <verse eid="JHN 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 15:14" />Mwambushange ngeci amwepo mu tenda eyi ni mi raerera. <verse eid="JHN 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 15:15" />Ka na ku mithsa karo ci apika, inene apika tumba a dimuka eyi a kwama ñathsire wo, uno honi ame naa mithsa ci ambushange, inene na ni mi tongwera yoihe eyi na ni yuvu kwa Tata. <verse eid="JHN 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 15:16" />Kadi yamwe na mu ni hangura, unone yame na ni mi hangura. Karo na ni mi hangura ci mu thze mu keme ima eyi ya kwikarerera, ci yoihe eyi mwa ku romba kwa Tata mu dithzina dyange a ku i mi pe. <verse eid="JHN 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 15:17" />Eyi yodiyo ni na mi raerera, ci mu cishime oandu.<verse eid="JHN 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kuthzimbiwa ku kaye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 15:18" />“Ngeci kaye kaa mi thzimba, mu dimuke ci yame na ka tanga tango ku thzimba. <verse eid="JHN 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 15:19" />Nga mwakwa kaye, kaye nga kaa mi shima eci anuako. Uno honi pakuninga ci kadi mwakwa kaye, unone na ni mi hangura ku mi tundithsa ku kaye, eyo ngeyi ka mi thzimbera kaye. <verse eid="JHN 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 15:20" />Mu vuruke maywi aa na ni mi ambera o ku ninga ci: ‘Ngamba tumba a piti ñathsire wenthzi.’ Ngeci na ni nyandithsa, namwe kenge a ku mi nyandithsa. Ngeci na hengeka maywi ange, kenge a ku hengeka na a enu kengeyo. <verse eid="JHN 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 15:21" />Unone kenge a ku tenda eyi yoihe ku kwenu mukaci kange, inene ka dimuka oyu naa ni tumu. <verse eid="JHN 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 15:22" />Nga ka na ni keya no ku na amba kukwo, nga ka di no murandu o thsivi, uno honi thsivi thso kwithsa edi a ku thsi hamura. <verse eid="JHN 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 15:23" />Yomuhe o ku ni thzimba aa thzimba no Tata kengeyo. <verse eid="JHN 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 15:24" />Nga ka na ni kwama mu kaciko ekwama eyi a kana ku kwamapo yumweya, nga ka di no murandu o thsivi, uno honi na mono no ku thzimba ame na Tata. <verse eid="JHN 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 15:25" />Uno honi eyi i na ñoriwa mu Murao wo yaa roera ku citombora, yo ku amba ci: ‘Na ni thzimbi ko kupira thsimweya.’<verse eid="JHN 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 15:26" />“Uno honi ou a ku keya aye Mukwakukwathsa, oyu na ku mi tumena ku tunda kwa Tata, aye Mupepo o shemwa oyu tunderera kwa Tata, kenge a ku na pa ombangi keyi yange. <verse eid="JHN 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 15:27" />Namwe kengeyo kenge mwa ku pa ombangi keyi yange, inene na mwikara nange ku tunda ku matatekero.<verse eid="JHN 15:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JHN 16" />
  <para style="rem">TA, TC, CC, TA</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 16:1" />“Na ni mi tongwera yoihe eyi ci katere mwa ku thsie thsitawo thsenu. <verse eid="JHN 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 16:2" />Kenge a ku mi cithza mu masinagoge, karo thsikati thsaa keya ethsi a ku anekera awa ku mipaa ci aa kwamena Nyambi. <verse eid="JHN 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 16:3" />Karo kenge a ku tenda eyi pakuninga ci ka na dimuka Tata, nji ame. <verse eid="JHN 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 16:4" />Uno honi ni na mi ambera eyi, ci thsikati thso ou thsa ku kuma mwa ku vuruke ci shime naa i mi tongwera.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="JHN 16:4">Ekwama ya Mupepo Oukenu</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 16:4">“Ka na ni mi tongwera eyi ku tunda ku matatekero, inene shime na nikara nenu. <verse eid="JHN 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 16:5" />Uno honi naa huka koyu naa ni tumu, karo kwithsa shaanga yofoci ku kwenu oyu nipura ci: ‘Kupi oku o thza?’ <verse eid="JHN 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 16:6" />Pakuninga ci ni na mi tongwera eyi, micima thzenu thzi na yara mathsiwa. <verse eid="JHN 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 16:7" />Naa mi tongwera yoshemwa ci ku di nawa ci ame ni thze, inene ngeci ka na ku thza, Mukwakukwathsa ka a ku keya ku kwenu. Uno honi yoihe ni thza, kenge na ku ka mu tuma ku kwenu. <verse eid="JHN 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 16:8" />Ou a ku keya kenge a ku na monithsa anu mu kaye thsivi thso no ku wa monithsa owawa no raturo: <verse eid="JHN 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 16:9" />keyi yo thsivi thso, pakuninga ci ka tawire ku kwange, <verse eid="JHN 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 16:10" />keyi yowawa, pakuninga ci naa thza kwa Tata, karo ka mwa ku ni mona karo, <verse eid="JHN 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 16:11" />keyi yo raturo, pakuninga ci muendithsi o kano kaye naa raturiwa kare.<verse eid="JHN 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 16:12" />“Shimbi nekarera neyi yoingi yo ku mi tongwera, uno honi tumba mu twethsa ku i shimba pano. <verse eid="JHN 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 16:13" />Ou a ku keya aye Mupepo o shemwa, kenge a ku na mi tangerera mushemwa ouhe, inene ka a ku na ciambera kokoro wenthzi, unone kenge a ku na amba eyi naa yuvu, karo a ku na mi rawera enu eyi i keya. <verse eid="JHN 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 16:14" />Kenge a ku reta ci ni piwe kutethzima, inene kenge a ku na mi rawera eyi a ku tambura ku kwange. <verse eid="JHN 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 16:15" />Yoihe ya Tata po yange, eyo ngeyi ni na mi amberera ci: ‘Mupepo kenge a ku na mi rawera eyi a ku tambura ku kwange.’<verse eid="JHN 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mathsiwa enu kenge a ku piruka thsinyanyu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 16:16" />“Ku na thsiara thsikati thsothsipu, ka mwa ku ni mona, unone munyima thzo thsikati thsothsipu, kenge mwa ku ni mona karo.”<verse eid="JHN 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 16:17" />Imweya kwirongwa yenthzi ya ciambathsanine ci: “Ine eyi a amba pa ku amba ci: ‘Ka mwa ku ni mona mu thsikati thsothsipu, unone munyima thzo thsikati thsothsipu kenge mwa ku ni mona karo’ karo ci: ‘inene naa thza kwa Tata?’ <verse eid="JHN 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 16:18" />Karo a amba ine pa ku amba ci: ‘thsikati thsothsipu?’ Ka tu yuvithsithsire eyi a amba.”<verse eid="JHN 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 16:19" />Yesu wa dimukire ci shime ya fotire ku mwipura, ngou a ambire ci: “Ene mwaa cipaura ci naa amba ine pa ku amba ci: ‘Ku na thsiara thsikati thsothsipu, ka mwa ku ni mona, karo munyima thzo thsikati thsothsipu kenge mwa ku ni mona karo?’ <verse eid="JHN 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 16:20" />Naa mi tongwera yoshemwa ci kenge mwa ku dira makuano mukaci keyi ya ku tendahara ku kwange, unone kaye ako kenge ka ku nyanyuka. Kenge mwa kwikara mu mathsiwa, unone mathsiwa enu kenge a ku piruka thsinyanyu. <verse eid="JHN 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 16:21" />Kenge ya ku cipitura eci kukora ko mbuyama oyu shamuruka. Mwane o ku na shamurukiwa aa vurama dikarara dyenthzi mukaci ko thsinyanyu pakuninga ci o na reta kambu mu kaye. <verse eid="JHN 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 16:22" />Dyo i di ku kwenu, mu mathsiwa mu di pano unone kenge na ku mi mona karo, karo kenge mwa ku nyanyuka, karo kwithsa oyu wa ku mi nyanga thsinyanyu thsenu. <verse eid="JHN 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 16:23" />Mo diya diyuwa ka mwa ku nipura thsimweya. Naa mi tongwera yoshemwa ci, yoihe eyi mwa ku romba Tata mu dithzina dyange, kenge a ku i mi pa. <verse eid="JHN 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 16:24" />Shime ku na kuma rerodino ka mwa rombapo thsimweya mu dithzina dyange. Mu rombe, karo kenge mwa ku piwa, ci thsinyanyu thsenu thsi kwanenene.<verse eid="JHN 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu naa othzo kaye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 16:25" />“Ni na amba eyi enu ko ku cikwathsithsa maambo. Thsikati thsaa keya apa na ku kana ku amba ku kwenu ko maambo, unone kenge na ku cinakana ku mi tongwera ya Tata. <verse eid="JHN 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 16:26" />Mo diya diyuwa kenge mwa ku romba mu dithzina dyange. Ka ni ambire ci kenge na ku mi rombera kwa Tata, <verse eid="JHN 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 16:27" />inene aye Tata thsinda aa mi shima, pakuninga ci mwaa ni shima no ku tawa ci kwa Nyambi na ni tundu. <verse eid="JHN 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 16:28" />Shime na ni tundu kwa Tata ku keya muno mu kaye, pano honi naa thsia kano kaye ku huka kwa Tata.”<verse eid="JHN 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 16:29" />Erongwa yenthzi ngou ya ambire ci: “Pano honi waa cinakana ku amba, ko ambire ko ku cikwathsithsa maambo. <verse eid="JHN 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 16:30" />Pano honi tu na dimuka ci o na dimuka enu yoihe karo kwithsa eyi nga a kwipawera munu, eyi ngeyi tu tawera ci kwa Nyambi no tundu.”<verse eid="JHN 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 16:31" />Yesu wepurire ci: “Ene mwaa na tawa honi? <verse eid="JHN 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 16:32" />Thsikati thsaa keya, mane thsi na kumu kare, apa mwa ku panthzaana munu no munu ku thza ku diumbo dyenthzi no ku ni thsia nofoci. Uno honi kadi nofoci ni di, inene Tata nange a di. <verse eid="JHN 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 16:33" />Ni na mi ambera eyi enu ci mwa kwikare no thsiyaro mu mwange. Muno mu kaye kenge mwa kwikara mu makando. Unone mu tanare micima, inene na ni othzo kaye.”<verse eid="JHN 16:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JHN 17" />
  <para style="rem">TA, CC, TC, TA</para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa ciromberera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 17:1" />Yesu ou a manine ku amba eyo wa diamenine ku wiru no ku amba ci: “Tata, thsikati thsi na kumu. O pe kutethzima Mwanoe ci naye Mwanoe a ku pe kutethzima. <verse eid="JHN 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 17:2" />Inene no mu pa okoro peuru thzanu wahe ci a pe mwoyo o diyere anu wahe awa no mu pa. <verse eid="JHN 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 17:3" />Honi ou po o mwoyo o diyere, ci a ku dimuke, owe o Nyambi yofoci o shemwa, no ku dimuka Yesu Krisitu oyu no tumu. <verse eid="JHN 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 17:4" />Na ni reta ci o piwe kutethzima mu kaye, ko ku mana ekwama eyi no ni pa ci ni i kwame. <verse eid="JHN 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 17:5" />Pano honi, Tata, o ni pe kutethzima pa meho oe kuya nekarire nako noe kaye o ku ka shime kumbiwa.<verse eid="JHN 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu aa romberera erongwa yenthzi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 17:6" />“Na ni ku hokora kwanu awa no ni pa kwanu o muno mu kaye. Ekarire anuoe. No wa ni pa, karo na hengeka diywi dyoe. <verse eid="JHN 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 17:7" />Pano honi aa dimuka ci eyi no ni pa yoihe yaa tunda ku koe. <verse eid="JHN 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 17:8" />Inene na ni wa pa maywi aa no ni pa, karo naa tambura. Na dimuka yoshemwa ci ku koe na ni tundu no ku tawa ci yowe no ni tumu.<verse eid="JHN 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 17:9" />“Naa wa romberera. Ka ni rombererire kaye, unone naa romberera awa no ni pa, inene oe. <verse eid="JHN 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 17:10" />Anuange wahe anuoe nowe, karo anuoe name anuange, karo naa piwa kutethzima mu mwo. <verse eid="JHN 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 17:11" />Pano ka ni di honi mu kaye, unone awo shimbi ekarera mu kaye, karo ame naa keya ku koe. Tata o Mukenu, o wa nyunge kokoro o dithzina dyoe, dithzina edi no ni pa ci ekare thsofoci, eci edi tu di atwe thsofoci. <verse eid="JHN 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 17:12" />Ou na nikarano na ni wa nyungu kokoro o dithzina dyoe edi no ni pa. Na ni wa mamera, kwithsa shaanga yofoci kukwo oyu na a yongo, shime yofoci oyu na roera ku nongithsiwa, ci Mañoro a citombore.<verse eid="JHN 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 17:13" />“Uno honi naa keya ku koe, karo naa amba eyi enu uno ni shime mu kaye, ci a yare thsinyanyu thsange mu micima thzo. <verse eid="JHN 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 17:14" />Na ni wa pa diywi dyoe, karo anu o kaye aa wa thzimba, inene awo kadi cingwa o kano kaye eci edi ni di ame ci kadi no mukwa kano kaye. <verse eid="JHN 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 17:15" />Ka ni rombire ci o wa tundithse mu kaye, unone naa romba ci o wa nyunge koyu o Mumango. <verse eid="JHN 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 17:16" />Kadi akwa kaye eci edi ni di ame ci kadi no mukwa kaye. <verse eid="JHN 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 17:17" />O wa kenithse koshemwa. Diywi dyoe po oshemwa. <verse eid="JHN 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 17:18" />Eci edi wa ni tumine mu kaye, name ni na wa tumu mu kaye. <verse eid="JHN 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 17:19" />Karo mukaciko, naa cipa nothsinda kwikara thsiyambero thsothsikenu ci a kenithsiwe mushemwa.<verse eid="JHN 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa romberera akwakutawa wahe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 17:20" />“Ka ni rombererire awa pohuma, unone naa romberera nowa a ku tawa ku kwange mukaci kombangi wo. <verse eid="JHN 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 17:21" />Tata, naa rombera ethsi ci nga wahe ekare thsofoci, eci dyodi o di mu mwange name mu moe. Nawo ekare mu mwetu, ci kaye nga ka tawe ci yowe no ni tumu.<verse eid="JHN 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 17:22" />“Na ni wa pa kuya kutethzima no ni pa ci nawo ekare thsofoci eci edi tu di natwe thsofoci. <verse eid="JHN 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 17:23" />Ame nikare mu mwo, nowe o wikare mu mwange, ci nga a cikwate pofoci ko kuyara, ci kaye ka ku dimuke ci yowe no ni tumu no ku dimuka ci o mukwa ku wa shima eci dyodi wa ni shima. <verse eid="JHN 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 17:24" />Tata, naa romba ci awo no ni pa a kwikare nange oku ni di, ci a mone kutethzima kwange oku no ni pa, inene wa ni shimine no kaye o ku ka shime kumbiwa.<verse eid="JHN 17:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 17:25" />“Tata o Muwawa, shaanga ci kaye ka ka ku dimuka, ame ni na ku dimuka, nowa nawo a na dimuka ci yowe no ni tumu. <verse eid="JHN 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 17:26" />Na ni ku hokora kukwo, karo kenge na ku twara ku rupara ku tenda kengeyo, ci thsishimo thsoe ku kwange thsikare mu mwo, name nikare mu mwo.”<verse eid="JHN 17:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JHN 18" />
  <para style="rem">TA, CC, TC, TA</para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa kwatiwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Mat 26.47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Mar 14.43-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luk 22.47-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 18:1" />Yesu ou a manine ku amba eyi, wa thzire nerongwa yenthzi mu thsambwadiya thzo muronga wa Kedironi. Oko kwekarire dikanda, Yesu nerongwa yenthzi a kengeninemo.<verse eid="JHN 18:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 18:2" />Uno honi Judasi oyu wa mu ombire, naye wa dimukire ethzo ndau, pakuninga ci Yesu shime aa ka ciwanenangako nerongwa yenthzi rorungi. <verse eid="JHN 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 18:3" />Judasi ngou a thzire oko ku dikanda o ku na tangerera thsipani thso mashwarare nakwakunyunga Tembere awa tundire kwakuru o mapurisita nAfarithsi. A shimbire tumbarambara, mataci nerwithsa.<verse eid="JHN 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 18:4" />Yesu ko ku dimuka yoihe eyi nga ya tendaharire ku kwenthzi, wa wa shambawerire no ku wepura ci: “Edye oyu mu fota?”<verse eid="JHN 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 18:5" />A mu tawire ci: “Yesu wa Nazareta.” Yesu wa wa tawire ci: “Yame.” Judasi oyu wa mu ombire wemanineno. <verse eid="JHN 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 18:6" />Yesu ou a wa amberire ci: “Yame,” a hukire thsirerenyima no ku wera pashi. <verse eid="JHN 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 18:7" />Wa wepurire karo ci: “Edye oyu mu fota?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:7">A ambire ci: “Yesu wa Nazareta.”<verse eid="JHN 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 18:8" />Yesu wa wa tawire ci: “Ni na mi tongwera ci: ‘Yame.’ Uno honi ngeci yame oyu mu fota, mu thsie awa a thze.” <verse eid="JHN 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 18:9" />Eyi shime ya tendaharire ci i citombore neyi a ambire ci: “Kowa no ni pa kwithsa shaanga yofoci oyu naa yongo.”<verse eid="JHN 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 18:10" />Simoni Peturu wekarire no mwere. Ngou a u shwamunine no ku teta ditwi dyo ku rudyo dya mupika mupurisita shokuru. Dithzina dyoyo mupika po nedi Maliko. <verse eid="JHN 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 18:11" />Yesu wa amberire Peturu ci: “O shwameke mwere woe mu ndaro thzao. Ene ka ni roerire ku nwa mu nganja thzo makando ethzi naa ni pa Tata?”<verse eid="JHN 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa twariwa kwa mupurisita shokuru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 18:12" />Mashwarare no muendithsi wo nakwakunyunga no tupathso to Majuda ngou a kwatire Yesu no ku mwanga. <verse eid="JHN 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 18:13" />A tangire ku mu twara kwa Anasi, hemwenya Kayafa, oyu wekarire mupurisita shokuru oo mwaka. <verse eid="JHN 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 18:14" />Kayafa yodiyo wa thsiururire Majuda ci ku di nawa ci munu yofoci a fere anu.<verse eid="JHN 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Peturu aa hamura Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:69-70">Mat 26.69-70</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:66-68">Mar 14.66-68</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:55-57">Luk 22.55-57</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 18:15" />Simoni Peturu no thsirongwa thsimweya a shupwerire Yesu. Pakuninga ci thsiya thsirongwa thsimweya thsa dimukiwire kwa mupurisita shokuru, thsengenine na Yesu mu dirapa dya mupurisita shokuru. <verse eid="JHN 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 18:16" />Peturu aye wa thsiarire pa thsero thzo dirapa, unone thsiya thsirongwa thsimweya thsiya thsa dimukiwire kwa mupurisita shokuru thsa punine pora. Thsa ambire noya mbuyamaana wa nyungire pa thsero, ngou engenithsire Peturu. <verse eid="JHN 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 18:17" />Oya mbuyamaana wa nyungire pa thsero wa amberire Peturu ci: “Ene kadi nowe o thsirongwa thsoyu munu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:17">Wa ambire ci: “Dyombo, kadi no thsirongwa thsenthzi.”<verse eid="JHN 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 18:18" />Angamba nakwakunyunga a fakarire mudiro o pa makara pakuninga ci shime kwomborire nene, emanine no ku u paka mu kaci o kwa yota. Peturu wemanineno naye o ku yota mudiro.<verse eid="JHN 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mupurisita shokuru aepura Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Mat 26.59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Mar 14.55-64</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:66-71">Luk 22.66-71</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 18:19" />Mupurisita shokuru ngou epurire Yesu keyi yerongwa yenthzi nerongithsa yenthzi. <verse eid="JHN 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 18:20" />Yesu wa tawire ci: “Na ni rongithsa kaye thsitonwameho. Shime na ni rongithsanga thsikati thsothsihe mu masinagoge no mu Tembere omu a na ciwanenanga Majuda wahe. Kwithsa eyi na ni amba ku mukunda. <verse eid="JHN 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 18:21" />Ine eyi o ni pwera? O wipure awa na yuvu eyi na ni wa ambera, a na dimuka eyi na ni amba.”<verse eid="JHN 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 18:22" />Yesu ou a ambire eyi, yumweya kwakwakunyunga oyu wemanine po pepi wa mu furire mbanda mu rupara no ku amba ci: “Ene dyo na roera ku tawa mupurisita shokuru kengeyo?”<verse eid="JHN 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 18:23" />Yesu wa tawire ci: “Ngeci eyi ni na amba po kwipithsa, o pe ombangi weyi i nepa. Uno honi ngeci ni na amba nawa ne, ine honi eyi o ni furera?”<verse eid="JHN 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 18:24" />Anasi ngou a tumithsire Yesu kwa Kayafa mupurisita shokuru o ku nangiwa.<verse eid="JHN 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Peturu aa hamura Yesu karo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:71-75">Mat 26.71-75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:69-72">Mar 14.69-72</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:58-62">Luk 22.58-62</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 18:25" />Simoni Peturu wemanine apo o ku yota mudiro. A mwipurire ci: “Ene kadi nowe o thsirongwa thsoyu munu?” Peturu wa hamurire, wa ambire ci: “Dyombo, kadi no thsirongwa thsenthzi.”<verse eid="JHN 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 18:26" />Yumweya wangamba mupurisita shokuru, mwapa oya mukwerume a tetire ditwi Peturu, wa ambire ci: “Kadi shime naa ka ku mona o ku di nenthzi mu dikanda, nji kadi kengeyo?” <verse eid="JHN 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 18:27" />Uno honi Peturu wa hamurire karo, popo ñombwe weyire.<verse eid="JHN 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu pa meho a Pilatu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Mat 27.1-2</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Mar 15.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Luk 23.1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 18:28" />Ngou a tundithsire Yesu mu nthzio thza Kayafa no ku mu twara ku marombe a Pilatu. Nedi mathsikuthsiku. Majuda a kanine kwingena mu marombe, inene eyo nga ya wa thsirekire, karo nga ka tawethziwire ku dya Paseka. <verse eid="JHN 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 18:29" />Pilatu ngou a punenine kukwo. Wa wepurire ci: “Ene murandu mwine ou mu thzekithsera oyu munu?”<verse eid="JHN 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 18:30" />A mu tawire ci: “Nga kwithsa ethsi a nepithsa nga ka tu mu retire ku koe.” <verse eid="JHN 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 18:31" />Pilatu wa wa amberire ci: “Mu mu shimbe yoyamwe mu mu rature kokuthza ko murao wenu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:31">Majuda a mu amberire ci: “Atwe ka tu tawethziwire kwipaa munu.” <verse eid="JHN 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 18:32" />Eyi ya tendaharire ci i citombore no maywi a Yesu o ku monithsa mushovo o kufa oku a fire.<verse eid="JHN 18:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 18:33" />Pilatu ngou a hukire mu marombe enthzi no kwithsa Yesu. Wa mwipurire ci: “Ene yowe o Fumu o Majuda nji?” <verse eid="JHN 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 18:34" />Yesu wa tawire ci: “Ene ethzi ngudi ne thzoe nji, nji kwa di awa a na ku tongwera keyi yange?”<verse eid="JHN 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 18:35" />Pilatu wa tawire ci: “Ene waa anekera ci no Mujuda? Anuoe nakuru o mapurisita wodiyo a na ku reta ku kwange. Ine eyi o na kwama?”<verse eid="JHN 18:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 18:36" />Yesu wa tawire ci: “Kutumina kwange kadi ko kano kaye. Kutumina kwange nga ko kano kaye, anduthziange nga a na ni rwera ci na piwa ku Majuda. Uno honi, kutumina kwange kadi ko kano kaye.”<verse eid="JHN 18:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 18:37" />Pilatu wa mwipurire ci: “Apo honi ne o fumu nji?” Yesu wa tawire ci: “O na amba, no fumu. Eyo yodiyo nerekiwerire no ku keya mu kaye ku na pa ombangi keyi yoshemwa. Munu yomuhe oyu di noshemwa aa teerera diywi dyange.”<verse eid="JHN 18:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Anu aa romba ku wa punithsera Barabasi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-31">Mat 27.15-31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-20">Mar 15.6-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luk 23.13-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 18:38" />Pilatu wa mwipurire ci: “Oshemwa ne ine?” Munyima thzo ku amba eyi, wa hukire pora ku Majuda ku ka wa ambera ci: “Ka ni mu wanenine murandu. <verse eid="JHN 18:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 18:39" />Unone ko thsithsemwa thsenu naa roera ku mi rukurwera thsinthzinda thsofoci pa Paseka. Ene mwaa fota ci ni mi rukurwere Fumu o Majuda?”<verse eid="JHN 18:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 18:40" />A yoomokire ci: “Dyombo! Kadi oyo, twaa fota Barabasi!” Uno honi Barabasi aye nedi thsikeremi.<verse eid="JHN 18:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JHN 19" />
  <para style="rem">TA, CC, TC, TA</para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa ratweriwa kufa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 19:1" />Pilatu ngou a tuminine ci Yesu a shimbiwe no ku mu mwashura. <verse eid="JHN 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 19:2" />Mashwarare a thzingire mushukwe o miunga no ku u paka ku mutwi wenthzi. A mu vatithsire thsikoveyo thso muvara o muhombohombo. <verse eid="JHN 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 19:3" />A mu keyerangire no ku mu varaera ci: “Shooshoo Fumu o Majuda.” A mu vakaurire mambanda.<verse eid="JHN 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 19:4" />Pilatu wa punine karo no ku na wa ambera ci: “Mu teerere, oyu munu naa mu punithsa ku kwenu ci mu mone ci ame ka ni wanine murandu o ku mu ratwera.” <verse eid="JHN 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 19:5" />Yesu wa punine o ku na vata mushukwe o miunga ku mutwi no thsikoveyo thso muvara o muhombohombo. Pilatu ngou a ambire ci: “Munu oyu!”<verse eid="JHN 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 19:6" />Apa a mu monine akuru o mapurisita nakwakunyunga Tembere a yoomokire ci: “O mwambe pa mbinda! O mwambe pa mbinda!” Pilatu wa ambire ci: “Mu mu shimbe yoyamwe mu ka mwambe, inene ame ka ni mu wanenine murandu.”<verse eid="JHN 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 19:7" />Akuru o Majuda a mu huthsire ci: “Tu di no murao, karo kokuthza koo murao, aa roera ku fa inene na cithsa ci Mwana Nyambi.”<verse eid="JHN 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 19:8" />Pilatu ou a wa yuvire o kwa amba kengeyo wa yapererire. <verse eid="JHN 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 19:9" />Wa hukire mu marombe no kwipura Yesu ci: “Oku wa tunda ne kupi?” Unone Yesu ka a mu tawire. <verse eid="JHN 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 19:10" />Pilatu wa mu amberire ci: “Ine eyi o kanena ku amba nange? Ko dimukire ci ame po ni di nokoro o ku ku rukurura nokoro o ku kwamba?”<verse eid="JHN 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 19:11" />Yesu wa mu tawire ci: “Ko di nokoro pa pange owe, shime okoro o ku ku pa Nyambi. Mukaci keyo oyu na ni pa ku koe o di no thsivi thsothsikuru kupita thsoe.”<verse eid="JHN 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 19:12" />Pilatu ou a i yuvire eyo, wa fotire nene ku rukurura Yesu. Unone Majuda a yoomokire ci: “Ngeci o mu rukurure oyo, kadi o mbusha Sesare. Munu yomuhe o ku cithsa ci fumu aa rwithsa Sesare.”<verse eid="JHN 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 19:13" />Pilatu pa ku yuva ao maywi wa punithsire Yesu pora, aye no kwikara mu thsipura thso ku ratwera pa ndau ethzi thzi nethsiwa ci “Mbanthza thzo Mawe” (mu Thsiheveru ci “Gabata”). <verse eid="JHN 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 19:14" />Edyo diyuwa nedi Diyuwa dyOciroithsero o Paseka, diyuwa o ku di kokera pa kaci ko mutwi. Pilatu wa amberire Majuda ci: “Fumu wenu oyu!”<verse eid="JHN 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 19:15" />A yoomokire ci: “O mu tware, o mu tware, o ka mwambe!” Pilatu wepurire ci: “Mwaa fota ci niambe Fumu wenu pa mbinda?” Akuru o mapurisita a tawire ci: “Ka tu di no fumu wao shime Sesare.”<verse eid="JHN 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 19:16" />Pilatu ngou a wa pire Yesu ci a ka mwambe pa mbinda.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="JHN 19:16">Yesu a ambiwa pa mbinda</para>
  <para style="r" vid="JHN 19:16">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Mat 27.32-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Mar 15.21-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luk 23.26-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:16">Ngou a shimbire Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 19:17" />Wa shimbire mbinda thzenthzi no ku puna ku thza ku ndau ethzi thzi nethsiwa Katendere (mu Thsiheveru ci “Gologota”). <verse eid="JHN 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 19:18" />Apo podiyo a kamberire Yesu, namweya aidi, oyu oku, oyu oku, Yesu mu kaciko. <verse eid="JHN 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 19:19" />Pilatu wa ñorire thsidimukithso ethsi a pakire pa mbinda thso ku amba ci: “YESU WA NAZARETA, FUMU O MAJUDA.” <verse eid="JHN 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 19:20" />Majuda owangi a varire ethso thsidimukithso inene apo pa ndau ambiwerire Yesu nedi pepi no thsikuña karo shime thsa ñoriwire mu Thsiheveru, Thsilatini no Thsigerike.<verse eid="JHN 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 19:21" />Akuru o mapurisita o Majuda a amberire Pilatu ci: “Wa ñora ci: ‘Fumu o Majuda,’ unone o ñore ci: ‘Oyu munu shime naa amba ci: “Yame no Fumu o Majuda.” ’ ” <verse eid="JHN 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 19:22" />Pilatu wa tawire ci: “Ethsi ni na ñoro ni na ñoro.”<verse eid="JHN 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 19:23" />Mashwarare ou a manine kwamba Yesu a ciererire eto yenthzi momune wo. A shimbire kengeyo no thsikoveyo thsenthzi ethsi thsa rukiwire pa thsito thsofoci ko kupira mufumo ku tunda ku wiru thzathso ku kuma no kushi thzathso. <verse eid="JHN 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 19:24" />Mashwarare a ciyongorire ci: “Twa thsi yatura, tu pepenu ñera tu mone oyu thsi shimba ci edye.” Eyi ya citomborire no Mañoro o ku ninga ci:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 19:24">“A na citepera eto yange</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 19:24">no ku pepera ñera thsivata thsange.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:18">Mem 22.18</ref>.</char></note></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:24">Eyo yodiyo a kwamine mashwarare.<verse eid="JHN 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 19:25" />Awa emanine po pepi no mbinda nedi mama wa Yesu no mina mama wa Yesu o mbuyama no Madiya munu wa Kolopasi no Madiya Magadalena. <verse eid="JHN 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 19:26" />Yesu ou a monine mama wenthzi noya thsirongwa a shimine nene o kwa nemana po pepi, wa amberire mama wenthzi ci: “Mama, mwanoe oyo.” <verse eid="JHN 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 19:27" />Karo wa amberire oya thsirongwa ci: “Njinoe oyo.” Ku tunda edyo diyuwa oya thsirongwa wa shimbire Madiya ku kekaranga nenthzi mu mwanda wenthzi.<figure style="fig" alt="Jesus on cross speaks to John and Mary" file="cn01840c.tif" size="col" loc="Jhn 19:25-27" copy="Cook" ref="19.25-27">Yesu aa amba na Johani na Madiya o ku di pa mbinda</figure><verse eid="JHN 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kufa kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Mat 27.45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Mar 15.33-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luk 23.44-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 19:28" />Munyima thzeyi, Yesu ko ku dimuka ci ekwama yenthzi i na kwana, karo ko kuninga ci Mañoro a citombore, wa ambire ci: “Ni na fu dinotwa.” <verse eid="JHN 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 19:29" />Apo pekarire kafuma ko kuyara ko waine o kuwawata. Ngou a cumbwiremo thsiponji no ku thsi shwameka ku katondo ko hisopa no ku thsi mu twarikethza ku miromo. <verse eid="JHN 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 19:30" />Yesu ou a manine ku nwa waine o kuwawata, wa ambire ci: “Ku na pu!” Popo wa nyongamine mutwi no ku mina mwoyo.<verse eid="JHN 19:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa kiñiwa mu maci</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 19:31" />Nedi Diyuwa dyOciroithsero, karo akuru o Majuda ka fotire ci erama yanu i kare kengeyo pa mambinda mu diyuwa dyo Savata edi dya randireko karo nedi Savata thzo Paseka. Ngou a rombire kwa Pilatu ci a wa cothzaure mauru a wamburepo. <verse eid="JHN 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 19:32" />Mashwarare ngou a keyire ku na cora mauru o mukwerume o ku tanga noyu o muthsidi waya ambiwire na Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 19:33" />Unone ou a kumine kwa Yesu no ku mona ci o na fu kare, ka corire mauru enthzi. <verse eid="JHN 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 19:34" />Uno honi, yumweya ku mashwarare wa shimbire ñothzi no ku thzi kiña Yesu mu maci, popo mwa tundire onyinga no meyu. <verse eid="JHN 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 19:35" />Oyu tongora eyi shime a i monine, karo aa pa ombangi o shemwa. Karo na dimuka ci aa tongora oshemwa, ci namwe nga mu tawe. <verse eid="JHN 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 19:36" />Eyi shime ya tendaharire ci i citombore neyi ya ñoriwire mu Mañoro yo kuninga ci: “Kwithsa kwishoko yenthzi shaanga thsofoci ethsi mba thsi coriwa.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:46">Diya 12.46</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 9:12">Muta 9.12</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 34:20">Mem 34.20</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 19:37" />Karo ko di di Diñoro dimweya dyo kuninga ci: “Kenge a ku mu kenga oyu na kiñi.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 12:10">Zak 12.10</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="JHN 19:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa vumbekiwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mat 27.57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mar 15.42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luk 23.50-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 19:38" />Munyima thzeyo, Josefa o ku Arimatea oyu wekarire thsirongwa thsa Yesu thso ku mukunda pa ku yapa akuru o Majuda, wa rombire Pilatu ci a mu tawethze ku kambura erama ya Yesu pa mbinda. Pilatu wa mu tawethzire, ngou a thzire no ku kambura erama ya Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 19:39" />Wa thzire na Nikodema oya mukwerume wa thzire kwa Yesu othsiku. Nikodema wa keyire no thsende o ku nuka nawa o mira o ku vandakana no aloe oremu o ku fota ku piterera makumi ahatu o makiro. <verse eid="JHN 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 19:40" />Ngou a shimbire erama ya Yesu no ku i vungera mu mambatu o lineni neyo ehefu yo ku nuka nawa. Thsodiyo thsithsemwa thso Majuda thso ku vumbeka munu. <verse eid="JHN 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 19:41" />Apo pa ndau amberire Yesu nedi pepi no dikanda omu mwekarire thsidi thsothsipe omu mwa kana ku vumbekiwa munu. <verse eid="JHN 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 19:42" />Pakuninga ci nedi Diyuwa dyo Majuda dyOciroithsero, karo thsidi thsekarire po pepi, a vumbekire momo Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 19:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JHN 20" />
  <para style="rem">TA, CC, TC, TA</para>
  <para style="s1">Thsidi thso mukunguru</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Mat 28.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Mar 16.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luk 24.1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 20:1" />Ruura mu diyuwa dyo kutanga mu sunda, o ku shimbi kwerawera pashi, Madiya Magadalena wa thzire ku thsidi. Wa wanine diwe o ku di na arumuniwa ku mengeneno o thsidi. <verse eid="JHN 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 20:2" />Ngou a cirerire kwa Simoni Peturu no thsiya thsirongwa a shimine nene Yesu. Wa ambire ci: “A na tundithsa erama ya Fumu mu thsidi, karo ka tu dimuka oku a na mu paka.”<verse eid="JHN 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 20:3" />Peturu no thsiya thsirongwa thsimweya ngou a thzire ku thsidi. <verse eid="JHN 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 20:4" />Momu widi wo shime a thzire o cira, unone thsiya thsirongwa thsimweya thsa cirire nene ku thsia Peturu, no ku ka tanga ku ka kuma ku thsidi. <verse eid="JHN 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 20:5" />Thsa kotamine ku hokera mu thsidi, thsa monine mambatu o lineni aa ekariremo, unone ka thsengeninemo. <verse eid="JHN 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 20:6" />Ngou Simoni Peturu oyu wa thsi keyire munyima a kumine no kwingena mu thsidi. Wa monine mambatu o lineni o ku a dimo, <verse eid="JHN 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 20:7" />thsiya thsito thsa thzingiwire ku mutwi wa Yesu o ku thsi na cifundafundera papo, o ku thsi na tundithsiwa ku mambatu o lineni. <verse eid="JHN 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 20:8" />Ku hura thsiya thsirongwa thsa tangire ku kuma ku thsidi, nathso thsengenine mu thsidi. Thsa monine no ku tawa. <verse eid="JHN 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 20:9" />(Shaanga apo ka ya yuvithsithsire Mañoro ci Yesu aa roera ku pinduka kwafu.) <verse eid="JHN 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 20:10" />Erongwa ngou ya hukire ku diumbo.<verse eid="JHN 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa hokoka kwa Madiya Magadalena</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:9-10">Mat 28.9-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:9-11">Mar 16.9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 20:11" />Unone Madiya aye shime emanine pora thzo thsidi o ku dira. O ku dira kengeyo wa kotamine ku kenga mu thsidi, <verse eid="JHN 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 20:12" />wa monine tungeru twidi otu twa vatire evata yo kuvyakima, o ku tu nekara apa ya pakiwire erama ya Yesu, kamweya ku mutwi kamweya ku mauru. <verse eid="JHN 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 20:13" />Tungeru twa mwipurire ci: “Owe mbuyama, ine eyi o direra?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:13">Aye wa tawire ci: “A na shimbi Fumu wange, karo ka ni dimuka oku a na mu paka.”<verse eid="JHN 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 20:14" />Munyima thzo ku amba eyo wa pirukire no ku mona oyu wemanine apo, unone ka a dimukire ci Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 20:15" />Yesu wa mwipurire ci: “Owe mbuyama, ine eyi o direra? Karo edye oyu o fota?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:15">Aye wa anekerire ci ngwa mukwakukwama mu dikanda, ngou a mu tawire ci: “Ñathsire wange, ngeci yowe na mu shimbi, o ni tongwere oku na ka mu paka, ni ka mu shimbeko.” <verse eid="JHN 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 20:16" />Yesu wa ambire ci: “Madiya!” Madiya wa cithsetukire no ku mu tawa mu Thsiheveru<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20.16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nji ci Thsiaramaiki.</char></note> ci: “Raboni!” (ku amba ci “Murongithsi”).<verse eid="JHN 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 20:17" />Yesu wa mu amberire ci: “Wa ni kundama, inene ni shime ku thzina mu wiru kwa Tata. Unone o thze kwaenthzange o ka wa tongwere ci naa thzina mu wiru kwa Tata aye Tata wenu namwe, Nyambi wange no Nyambi wenu namwe.”<verse eid="JHN 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 20:18" />Madiya Magadalena wa thzire no ku ka tongwera erongwa ci: “Ni na mu mono Fumu!” Ngou a i tongwerire enu yoihe eyi a mu amberire Fumu.<verse eid="JHN 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa hokoka kwirongwa yenthzi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Mat 28.16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Mar 16.14-18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luk 24.36-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 20:19" />Runguro o diyuwa dyo kutanga mu sunda, mathsero omu yekarire erongwa o ku a na patiwa mukaci ko ku yapa aendithsi o Majuda, Yesu wa keyire no ku nemana mu kaci kayo no ku i ambera ci: “Thsiyaro thsikare nenu!” <verse eid="JHN 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 20:20" />Ou a manine ku amba eyi, wa i monithsire nyara thzenthzi no maci thzenthzi. Erongwa yenthzi ya nyanyukire nene apa ya monine Fumu! <verse eid="JHN 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 20:21" />Yesu wa ambire karo ci: “Thsiyaro thsikare nenu! Eci dyodi naa ni tumu Tata, name naa mi tuma kengeyo.” <verse eid="JHN 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 20:22" />Ou a manine ku amba eyi, wa wa puyerire mupepo no ku amba ci: “Mu tambure Mupepo Oukenu. <verse eid="JHN 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 20:23" />Ngeci amwepo mu tetera anu evi yo, kenge a ku teteriwa. Ngeci ka mu wa teterire, ka ku teteriwa.”<verse eid="JHN 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa hokoka kwa Tomasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 20:24" />Yumweya kowaya o dikumi naidi, o dithzina dyo Tomasi, oyu wethsiwire ci o Marambi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20.24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Didimasi mu Thsigerike.</char></note> ka ekarireno Yesu ou a keyire. <verse eid="JHN 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 20:25" />Aenthzenthzi erongwa ya mu tongwerire ci: “Tu na mu mono Fumu!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:25">Unone aye wa tawire ci: “Ka ni i tawa shime ou nga ni mona etwa yo mambambo mu moko enthzi no kwingenithsamo munwe wange, no ku kwata ko dyoko dyange mu thsitwa thso mu maci thzenthzi.”<verse eid="JHN 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 20:26" />Munyima thzo sunda, erongwa ya ciwanine pofoci karo mu nthzio, apo honi no Tomasi pa ekarire. Mathsero shime a patiwire, unone Yesu wa keyire no ku nemana mu kaci kayo. Wa ambire ci: “Thsiyaro thsikare nenu!” <verse eid="JHN 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 20:27" />Yesu ngou a amberire Tomasi ci: “O pake munwe woe omu, o kenge mu moko ange. O kwate ko dyoko dyoe mu thsitwa thso mu maci thzange. O thsie ku kana ku tawa, o tawe!”<verse eid="JHN 20:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 20:28" />Tomasi wa tawire ci: “Fumu wange no Nyambi wange!” <verse eid="JHN 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 20:29" />Yesu wa mu amberire ci: “O na tawa honi pakuninga ci o na ni mono. Akwathsiyauthzi awa tawa ko kukana ku ni mona.”<verse eid="JHN 20:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eyi thza ñoriwerire ethzi vuka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 20:30" />Yesu wa tendire emonithso yo ku komokithsa imweya yoingi pa meho erongwa yenthzi, eyi i na kana ku ñoriwa omu mu vuka. <verse eid="JHN 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 20:31" />Uno honi eyi po shime ya ñoriwire ci mu tawe ci Yesu po yo Mesiya, Mwana Nyambi, ci pa ku tawa ku kwenthzi nga mu wane mwoyo ko dithzina dyenthzi.<verse eid="JHN 20:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JHN 21" />
  <para style="rem">TA, CC, TC, TA</para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa hokoka kwirongwa yenthzi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 21:1" />Munyima thzeyi, Yesu wa hokokire karo kwirongwa yenthzi ku Diviya dya Tiberiya. Shime a cihokorire kenge: <verse eid="JHN 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 21:2" />Simoni Peturu, Tomasi (oyu wethsiwire o Marambi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21.2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Didimasi mu Thsigerike.</char></note>), Natanaele o mu Kana o mu Galilea, ana Zebedea, namweya aidi kwirongwa yenthzi shime ekarire pofoci. <verse eid="JHN 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 21:3" />Simoni Peturu wa wa amberire ci: “Naa thza mu kuyamba.” A mu amberire ci: “Natwe twaa thza noe.” Ngou a thzire no ku ka yomama mu wato, unone uya othsiku kwithsa ethsi a wanine.<figure style="fig" alt="Disciples meet Jesus in Galilee" file="lb00330b.tif" size="span" loc="Jhn 21:4-6" copy="Knowles" ref="21.4-6">Erongwa yaa ka ciwana na Yesu mu Galilea</figure><verse eid="JHN 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 21:4" />Mu ruura, Yesu wemanine pa dikambo, unone erongwa ka ya dimukire ci Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 21:5" />Yesu wa i amberire ci: “Andengenu, ene ka mu diko no thsi nji?” Ya mu tawire ci: “Kwithsa.” <verse eid="JHN 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 21:6" />Wa i amberire ci: “Mu kuhere dituwa ku rudyo ro wato, kenge mwipaa!” Ngou ya kuherire dituwa, unone ka ya twethsire ku di koka mukaci ko thsi ongi.<verse eid="JHN 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 21:7" />Thsiya thsirongwa a shimine nene Yesu, thsa amberire Peturu ci: “Fumu!” Simoni Peturu ou a yuvire ci Fumu, wa vatire thsikoveyo thso peuru pakuninga ci shime a thsi cishupurire, wa reerire mu meyu no ku thza pa dikambo. <verse eid="JHN 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 21:8" />Unone erongwa imweya ayo ya thsiarire mu wato o ku i koka dituwa dyo ku yara dyo thsi, inene ka yekarire kokure no dikambo, nedi manambo o ku fota ku kwana makumi o dikumi. <verse eid="JHN 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 21:9" />Ou ya kumine pa dikambo, ya monine mudiro o pa makara no thsi po no dikende ku mbadi. <verse eid="JHN 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 21:10" />Yesu wa i amberire ci: “Mu rete ku thsi ethzi mu nepaa ñanyiñanyi.”<verse eid="JHN 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 21:11" />Simoni Peturu ngou a shamukerire mu wato no ku kokera dituwa pa dikambo, edi dya yarire ethsi thzothzikuru thzo ku kwana 153. Shaanga ci shime pa rwire ethsi thzothzingi kengeyo, edyo dituwa ka dya yatukire. <verse eid="JHN 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 21:12" />Yesu wa i amberire ci: “Mu keye na mu dye.” Kwithsa kweyo erongwa ethsi thsa keshukire ku mwipura ci: “Yowe o dye?” Inene ya dimukire ci nedi yodiyo Fumu. <verse eid="JHN 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 21:13" />Yesu ngou a keyire no ku shimba dikende no ku i pa, wa tendire kengeyo no ku thsi. <verse eid="JHN 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 21:14" />Oru nedi ro muthsihatu oru a hokokire Yesu kwirongwa yenthzi munyima thzo ku pinduriwa kwafu.<verse eid="JHN 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu na Peturu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 21:15" />Ou a manine ku dya, Yesu wa amberire Simoni Peturu ci: “Simoni mwana Johani, ene o mukwa ku ni shima kupita eyi nji?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:15">Wa tawire ci: “Ii, Fumu, o na dimuka ci no mukwa ku ku shima.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:15">Yesu wa mu amberire ci: “O korere manguana ange.”<verse eid="JHN 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 21:16" />Yesu wa hukerire ku mwipura ci: “Simoni mwana Johani, ene o mukwa ku ni shima?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:16">Peturu wa tawire ci: “Ii, Fumu, o na dimuka ci no mukwa ku ku shima.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:16">Yesu wa mu amberire ci: “O dithse mangu ange.” <verse eid="JHN 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 21:17" />Yesu wa mu amberire ro muthsihatu ci: “Simoni mwana Johani, ene o mukwa ku ni shima?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:17">Peturu wa ciyuvire omango ku mucima, inene Yesu wa mwipurire ethzo ngudi ro muthsihatu. Wa mu tawire ci: “Fumu, o na dimuka enu yoihe, o na dimuka ci no mukwa ku ku shima.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:17">Yesu wa mu amberire ci: “O korere mangu ange.<verse eid="JHN 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 21:18" />“Naa ku tongwera yoshemwa ci: o ku di oshumba, no civatekanga othsinda no ku thza kokuhe oku wa fotire. Uno honi ou wa ku kurupara kenge wa ku vapura moko oe anuawo no ku ku vateka ku ku twara oku o na kana ku fota ku thza.” <verse eid="JHN 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 21:19" />Yesu wa ambire eyi ku monithsa ci kufa ko ngepi a ku pa Nyambi kutethzima. Ou a manine ku amba eyi wa mu amberire ci: “O ni shupwere.”<verse eid="JHN 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu nothsiya thsirongwa a shimine nene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 21:20" />Peturu wa cithsetukire no ku mona thsiya thsirongwa a shimine nene Yesu o ku thsi wa shupwera. Ethsi thsirongwa thsodiyo thsiya thsa yendamenine Yesu pa murarero o mahurerero, thsiya thsa mwipurire ci: “Fumu, edye oyu wa ku ku omba?”<verse eid="JHN 21:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 21:21" />Peturu ou a thsi monine, wepurire Yesu ci: “Fumu, oyu aye ne ngepi?” <verse eid="JHN 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 21:22" />Yesu wa tawire ci: “Ngeci naa fota ci a yoye shime apa na ku ka hukera ne, eyo ne ine ku koe? Owe po o ni shupwere pohuma.”<verse eid="JHN 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 21:23" />Mweyo, ao mapurwatwi a yukire mu kaci kakwakutawa ci ethso thsirongwa ka thsa ku fa. Uno honi eyo ka di yodiyo a ambire Yesu, unone shime a ambire pohuma ci: “Ngeci naa fota ci a yoye shime ku ka kuma apa na ku ka hukera ne, eyo ne ine ku koe?”<verse eid="JHN 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 21:24" />Ethsi thsodiyo thsirongwa ethsi thsi pa ombangi weyi enu eyi karo thsodiyo na thsi i ñoro. Karo tu na dimuka ci ombangi wathso wa shemwa.<verse eid="JHN 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 21:25" />Yesu wa kwamine enu yoingi imweya. Nga ci i ñoriwe yoihe, naa anekera ci ao mavuka nga a ñoriwa tumba nga a kwanamo mu kaye kokahe.<verse eid="JHN 21:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 21" />
</usx>